<!doctype lake><title>𝐅𝐋𝐀𝐒𝐇-𝐀𝐓𝐓𝐍</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="lvd5X" id="lvd5X" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u3df2ab49" id="u3df2ab49">🐩</span><span data-lake-id="uaca0b546" id="uaca0b546"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uabcee899" id="uabcee899" style="color: rgb(31, 31, 31); background-color: rgb(253, 252, 252)">𝐅𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐡𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: 𝐅𝐚𝐬𝐭 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐌𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐫𝐲-𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐄𝐱𝐚𝐜𝐭 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐈𝐎-𝐀𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐬𝐬</span></strong></h1><p data-lake-id="u235a931c" id="u235a931c"><span data-lake-id="uf7a01feb" id="uf7a01feb">Transformer 的参数规模不断扩大，网络深度也持续增加。然而，为 Transformer 配备更长的上下文窗口仍然十分困难，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue210717c" id="ue210717c">其核心原因在于自注意力模块的时间复杂度和内存复杂度均随序列长度呈二次增长</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u867d5a89" id="u867d5a89">。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0b89e4c7" id="u0b89e4c7" style="color: #DF2A3F">因此，一个重要问题是：能否通过提高注意力计算的速度和内存效率，缓解 Transformer 在处理长序列时所面临的运行时间与内存瓶颈</span></strong></p><ul list="u9059b55c"><li fid="u26e3046d" data-lake-id="u34989542" id="u34989542"><span data-lake-id="u0aa3dd61" id="u0aa3dd61">大量近似注意力方法试图降低注意力计算所需的计算量和内存开销。这些方法包括稀疏近似、低秩近似，以及二者的组合。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue9020d7b" id="ue9020d7b" style="color: #C99103">尽管这些方法可以将计算复杂度降低至关于序列长度的线性或近线性级别，但其中许多方法相较于标准注意力并未表现出明显的实际运行时间优势</span></strong></li><li fid="u26e3046d" data-lake-id="uc9fae88f" id="uc9fae88f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u98311267" id="u98311267" style="color: #663000">上述方法主要关注浮点运算次数的减少，而 FLOPs 的降低并不必然转化为墙钟时间的缩短。同时，这些方法通常忽略内存访问所产生的 I/O 开销</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u568b7d31" id="u568b7d31"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2d8dbfdc" id="u2d8dbfdc" style="color: #004347">注意力算法设计中缺失的一项重要原则是 I/O 感知，即需要精确考虑不同速度、不同层级存储器之间的数据读写过程。例如，在 GPU 中，片上 SRAM 的访问速度较快，但容量较小；高带宽显存 HBM 的容量较大，但访问速度相对较慢</span></strong></p><ul list="uec43d36c"><li fid="u0a3178af" data-lake-id="uf2453884" id="uf2453884"><strong><span data-lake-id="u711415e8" id="u711415e8" style="color: #101E60">在现代 GPU 上，计算能力的增长速度已经超过内存带宽的增长速度，因此 Transformer 中的大量操作实际上受限于内存访问，而非纯粹的算术计算</span></strong></li><li fid="u0a3178af" data-lake-id="ub0b34787" id="ub0b34787"><span data-lake-id="ub2ca496e" id="ub2ca496e">对于数据库连接、图像处理、数值线性代数等内存受限任务，I/O 感知算法已经被证明至关重要，因为数据读写可能占据总体运行时间的很大一部分</span></li><li fid="u0a3178af" data-lake-id="u854fe28b" id="u854fe28b"><span data-lake-id="u99acba15" id="u99acba15">PyTorch 和 TensorFlow 等常用深度学习框架所提供的 Python 接口，通常无法对底层内存访问过程进行细粒度控制</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u234e7d11" id="u234e7d11"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub062008f" id="ub062008f">FlashAttention 的核心目标，是避免在 HBM 中显式写入和读取完整的注意力矩阵。实现这一目标需要解决两个关键问题</span></strong></p><ul list="u2568043b"><li fid="ud6852926" data-lake-id="u2c535eab" id="u2c535eab"><span data-lake-id="u894fec5e" id="u894fec5e">在无法一次访问完整输入的情况下完成 Softmax 归约与归一化计算</span></li><li fid="ud6852926" data-lake-id="u6e4a225e" id="u6e4a225e"><span data-lake-id="uc1e84110" id="uc1e84110">在反向传播过程中避免存储规模巨大的中间注意力矩阵</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4eeb50dd" id="u4eeb50dd"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc79c3dca" id="uc79c3dca" style="color: #5C0036">FlashAttention，一种基于分块计算的 I/O 感知型精确注意力算法。该算法通过分块技术，显著减少 GPU 高带宽显存（High Bandwidth Memory，HBM）与片上静态随机存取存储器（SRAM）之间的数据读写次数</span></strong></p><ul list="u2dd41843"><li fid="u12049a12" data-lake-id="u1d97a312" id="u1d97a312"><strong><span data-lake-id="u25cbec34" id="u25cbec34">重新组织注意力计算过程：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9f32cce1" id="u9f32cce1">将输入划分为多个数据块，并对这些输入块进行多次遍历，从而以增量方式完成 Softmax 的归约与归一化。这种计算方式通常称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc008c101" id="uc008c101">分块计算</span></strong></li><li fid="u12049a12" data-lake-id="u73849b95" id="u73849b95"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3b207759" id="u3b207759">仅保存前向传播过程中得到的 Softmax 归一化因子：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u66313d91" id="u66313d91">在反向传播阶段，算法利用这些归一化因子，在 GPU 片上重新计算注意力结果。与从 HBM 中读取完整的中间注意力矩阵相比，这种片上重计算方式具有更高的运行效率</span></li><li fid="u12049a12" data-lake-id="uf2a51d81" id="uf2a51d81"><span data-lake-id="ub750d0b3" id="ub750d0b3">使用 CUDA 实现 FlashAttention，以便对内存访问进行细粒度控制，并将注意力计算中的各项操作融合到单个 GPU 内核中。尽管重计算会增加一定数量的浮点运算，但由于大幅减少 HBM 数据访问，FlashAttention 仍然能够同时获得更快的运行速度和更低的内存占用。</span></li><li fid="u12049a12" data-lake-id="uf206a66b" id="uf206a66b"><span data-lake-id="ua456c4f1" id="ua456c4f1">设序列长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZH10X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u344b1821" id="u344b1821">，注意力头维度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RSRkN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d7f8198" id="u6d7f8198">，GPU 片上 SRAM 的容量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb94a7267a8199420f7bbc0afffecc851.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rXTDn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8bca1468" id="u8bca1468">，则 FlashAttention 所需的 HBM 访问量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(N%5E2d%5E2M%5E%7B-1%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ab8e8bc73dd30eecef7d73c6bd00948.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZJBxF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u429afc3d" id="u429afc3d">标准注意力算法所需的 HBM 访问量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5COmega(Nd%2BN%5E2).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd6528cb590d68cfea30e93e4910c8123.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xsuN0%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u972d0d00" id="u972d0d00"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5a952fdc" id="u5a952fdc">FlashAttention 通过优化 GPU 内存访问，在保持精确注意力计算的同时显著提升 Transformer 的训练效率，并支持更长序列建模</span></strong></p><ul list="u2af79538"><li fid="u9b0cc516" data-lake-id="u2d0d7581" id="u2d0d7581"><span data-lake-id="u0fa0c1f8" id="u0fa0c1f8">在计算效率方面，块稀疏 FlashAttention 将精确注意力扩展为近似的块稀疏形式，其运行速度快于已有近似注意力方法</span></li><li fid="u9b0cc516" data-lake-id="u23d2fd90" id="u23d2fd90"><span data-lake-id="uce3fb76d" id="uce3fb76d">在训练速度方面，FlashAttention 在 BERT-large、GPT-2 和 Long Range Arena 等任务上分别实现 15%、3 倍和 2.4 倍的训练加速</span></li><li fid="u9b0cc516" data-lake-id="u449f4718" id="u449f4718"><span data-lake-id="u60cd408b" id="u60cd408b">在模型性能方面，更长的上下文使 GPT-2 的困惑度降低 0.7，并使长文档分类性能提升 6.4 个百分点</span></li><li fid="u9b0cc516" data-lake-id="u31898df2" id="u31898df2"><span data-lake-id="uab87b808" id="uab87b808">在长序列建模方面，FlashAttention 支持 16K 序列，并在 Path-X 上达到 61.4% 的准确率；块稀疏 FlashAttention进一步将序列长度扩展至 64K，并在 Path-256 上达到 63.1% 的准确率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2e0983fa" id="u2e0983fa" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1754615222299-33d301a4-5f30-4dbb-a9e4-1173957122cb.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3588ab47-5274-4a29-9be0-d8025a5da31%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ube631734-c371-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A838.3624877929688%2C%22height%22%3A333%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A98721%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1194%2C%22originHeight%22%3A474%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANDWIDTH%26MEMORYSIZE%22%2C%22x%22%3A68%2C%22y%22%3A368%2C%22width%22%3A258%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEMORYHIERARCHYWITH%22%2C%22x%22%3A75%2C%22y%22%3A339%2C%22width%22%3A236%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTENTIONONGPT-2%22%2C%22x%22%3A912%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A187%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HBM%3A1.5TB%2FS(40GB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A198%2C%22y%22%3A200%2C%22width%22%3A185%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SRAM%3A19TB%2FS(20MB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A160%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A205%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SM(QKV%3ANXD%22%2C%22x%22%3A401%2C%22y%22%3A376%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAM%3A12.8GB%2FS%22%2C%22x%22%3A233%2C%22y%22%3A260%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LASHATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A538%2C%22y%22%3A440%2C%22width%22%3A143%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COPYBLOCKTOSRAM%22%2C%22x%22%3A573%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FLASHATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A1017%2C%22y%22%3A367%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTTOHBM%22%2C%22x%22%3A609%2C%22y%22%3A351%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AINMEMORY%22%2C%22x%22%3A76%2C%22y%22%3A262%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(%3E1TB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A284%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MATMUL%22%2C%22x%22%3A970%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(CPUDRAM%22%2C%22x%22%3A76%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNNERLOOP%22%2C%22x%22%3A550%2C%22y%22%3A418%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OMPUTEBLOCK%22%2C%22x%22%3A578%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210%22%2C%22x%22%3A851%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTERLOOP%22%2C%22x%22%3A571%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTERLOOP%22%2C%22x%22%3A592%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTMAX%22%2C%22x%22%3A977%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A729%2C%22y%22%3A202%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A119%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PYTORCH%22%2C%22x%22%3A898%2C%22y%22%3A368%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DROPOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A977%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A812%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A87%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HBM%22%2C%22x%22%3A116%2C%22y%22%3A218%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ERNEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1066%2C%22y%22%3A286%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONSRAM%22%2C%22x%22%3A588%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FUSED%22%2C%22x%22%3A1065%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%22%2C%22x%22%3A494%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MATMUL%22%2C%22x%22%3A976%2C%22y%22%3A328%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Q%3ANXD%22%2C%22x%22%3A418%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22V%3ANXD%22%2C%22x%22%3A754%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COPYL%22%2C%22x%22%3A464%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A397%2C%22y%22%3A223%2C%22width%22%3A15%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%B7%22%2C%22x%22%3A397%2C%22y%22%3A204%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A121%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KT%3ADXN%22%2C%22x%22%3A449%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%81%93%22%2C%22x%22%3A851%2C%22y%22%3A211%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A55%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OPY%22%2C%22x%22%3A734%2C%22y%22%3A204%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%90%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A490%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MASK%22%2C%22x%22%3A977%2C%22y%22%3A282%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2215-%22%2C%22x%22%3A867%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225-%22%2C%22x%22%3A874%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225%22%2C%22x%22%3A384%2C%22y%22%3A268%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%22%2C%22x%22%3A847%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SRAM%22%2C%22x%22%3A119%2C%22y%22%3A167%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fefcfb%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PixSm%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="NnGWF" id="NnGWF" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7db900c9" id="u7db900c9">🪶</span><span data-lake-id="u92eb93c5" id="u92eb93c5"> 𝐁𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u8fd65e10" id="u8fd65e10"><strong><span data-lake-id="u64fd7120" id="u64fd7120" style="color: #663000">GPU 存储层次结构：GPU 的存储层次结构由多种容量和访问速度不同的存储器组成。通常，容量越小的存储器，其访问速度越快</span></strong></p><ul list="u68d08f09"><li fid="uee6b518f" data-lake-id="ue8b71111" id="ue8b71111"><span data-lake-id="u77d4329b" id="u77d4329b">以 NVIDIA A100 GPU 为例，其配备 40–80 GB 的高带宽显存，带宽约为 1.5–2.0 TB/s。同时，A100 包含 108 个流式多处理器，每个 SM 配备 192 KB 的片上 SRAM，其总带宽估计约为 19 TB/s</span></li><li fid="uee6b518f" data-lake-id="ub7751b1b" id="ub7751b1b"><span data-lake-id="u029d7c47" id="u029d7c47">片上 SRAM 的访问速度比 HBM 高一个数量级，但其容量却小多个数量级。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud235ad6f" id="ud235ad6f" style="color: #AD1A2B">随着 GPU 计算能力相对于存储器访问速度不断提升，越来越多的计算操作受到 HBM 访问开销的限制。因此，如何充分利用高速片上 SRAM，已经成为提高 GPU 程序执行效率的关键</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0e5f09e4" id="u0e5f09e4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1788396914586-2c705e06-5132-4092-b572-470049e7ab60.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u699ec739-5469-47ce-a54f-7faa93a1183%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u204d415f-32d2-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A599%2C%22height%22%3A341%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A92358%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A895%2C%22originHeight%22%3A509%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22GLOBALMEMORY(80GB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A331%2C%22y%22%3A466%2C%22width%22%3A227%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L2CACHE(5OMB)%22%2C%22x%22%3A356%2C%22y%22%3A398%2C%22width%22%3A172%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SM-TO-SM7XGM)%22%2C%22x%22%3A109%2C%22y%22%3A362%2C%22width%22%3A175%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONSTANFCACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A681%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A169%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REGISFERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A713%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONSTANFCACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A288%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REGISFERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A328%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SHARED%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SHARED%22%2C%22x%22%3A286%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REGISTERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A73%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22~3TB%2FS%22%2C%22x%22%3A736%2C%22y%22%3A462%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONSTANFCACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A36%2C%22y%22%3A249%2C%22width%22%3A163%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SHARED%22%2C%22x%22%3A678%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONFROL%22%2C%22x%22%3A92%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A127%2C%22y%22%3A314%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEMORY%22%2C%22x%22%3A276%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONFROL%22%2C%22x%22%3A341%2C%22y%22%3A54%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEMORY%22%2C%22x%22%3A675%2C%22y%22%3A316%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONTFROL%22%2C%22x%22%3A734%2C%22y%22%3A54%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORECORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A88%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A372%2C%22y%22%3A314%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A780%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEMORY%22%2C%22x%22%3A26%2C%22y%22%3A314%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A373%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A157%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A676%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A714%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A324%2C%22y%22%3A157%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SM%22%2C%22x%22%3A104%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A291%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A762%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A812%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A158%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SM%22%2C%22x%22%3A750%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A112%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ECORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A148%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A427%2C%22y%22%3A160%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A68%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RECORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A792%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A288%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A66%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A367%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A329%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A420%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SM%22%2C%22x%22%3A358%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A678%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L1%22%2C%22x%22%3A390%2C%22y%22%3A288%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A759%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23a2dae3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u68ffe2a3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ubf012c72" id="ubf012c72"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue0186eae" id="ue0186eae" style="color: #000000">GPU 执行模型：GPU 包含大量并行线程，可用于执行某一计算操作，该操作通常被称为一个</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u0f1d0b59" id="u0f1d0b59">计算内核</span></strong></p><ul list="u9b5e1554"><li fid="u1808714b" data-lake-id="ud152b76f" id="ud152b76f"><span data-lake-id="uaf5b4f9e" id="uaf5b4f9e" style="color: #000000">在执行过程中，每个计算内核首先将输入数据从 HBM 加载至寄存器和片上 SRAM，随后完成相应计算，最后再将计算结果写回 HBM。因而，内核执行时间不仅取决于算术运算量，还与 HBM 和片上存储器之间的数据传输量密切相关</span></li><li fid="u1808714b" data-lake-id="u89752b36" id="u89752b36"><span data-lake-id="uc59b6edd" id="uc59b6edd" style="color: #000000">根据计算量与内存访问量之间的相对关系，GPU 操作通常可以分为计算受限和内存受限两类</span></li><li fid="u1808714b" data-lake-id="u12f7956c" id="u12f7956c"><strong><span data-lake-id="udca1276e" id="udca1276e">计算受限（compute-bound）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u33d16fa8" id="u33d16fa8" style="color: #000000">此类操作的运行时间主要由算术运算量决定，而访问 HBM 所消耗的时间相对较少。典型操作包括内维度较大的矩阵乘法，以及通道数较多的卷积运算</span></li><li fid="u1808714b" data-lake-id="u19f5f7d9" id="u19f5f7d9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u825c24a2" id="u825c24a2">内存受限（memory-bound）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3c70cd60" id="u3c70cd60" style="color: #000000">此类操作的运行时间主要由内存访问次数决定，而实际算术计算所消耗的时间相对较少。除大型矩阵乘法和卷积外，许多常见操作都属于内存受限操作，包括逐元素操作，如激活函数和 Dropout，以及归约操作，如求和、Softmax、批归一化和层归一化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u198f5786" id="u198f5786"><strong><span data-lake-id="u431e6b51" id="u431e6b51">内核融合：加速内存受限操作最常用的方法是内核融合。当多个操作作用于同一输入时，可以将这些操作融合到同一个计算内核中，使输入数据只需从 HBM 加载一次，而不必针对每个操作分别加载</span></strong></p><ul list="u92d666a4"><li fid="ue348b940" data-lake-id="u4799a828" id="u4799a828"><span data-lake-id="u1076f239" id="u1076f239">现代编译器已经能够自动融合许多逐元素操作。然而，在模型训练场景中，反向传播通常需要使用前向传播产生的中间结果。因此，这些中间值仍然需要被写入 HBM 并保存，从而限制简单内核融合方法所能取得的性能收益</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4ec2e4f1" id="u4ec2e4f1"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubebaf082" id="ubebaf082">标准注意力的实现：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4ed87e04" id="u4ed87e04">给定输入序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%2CK%2CV%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3011c88457914582c427ec28c93f853b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SnjXJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udfc38fce" id="udfc38fce">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dmIqH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0e774cb" id="uc0e774cb">表示序列长度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ds7be%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u13a017cc" id="u13a017cc">表示单个注意力头的维度。注意力机制需要计算输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6028cbf9c1c85bbc75e50095bdf5b404.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YRdBd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u358205a3" id="u358205a3">标准注意力的计算过程为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7e6c235f" id="u7e6c235f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsoftmax%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf385f967f614c04e0fd85951a8127ce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jJHG6%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub4f5b838"><li fid="ubdc3618a" data-lake-id="u6126d599" id="u6126d599"><span data-lake-id="udb68dcad" id="udb68dcad">其中，Softmax 沿矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55fc237afbe535f7d8434985b848a6a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MeFhi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u772b2fb4" id="u772b2fb4">的每一行进行计算。标准注意力实现会在 HBM 中显式生成并存储中间矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55fc237afbe535f7d8434985b848a6a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p2hQN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u63c2b551" id="u63c2b551">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ad7f899c1dacfd57bce71eaa5d79d2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VsXST%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u290a2c6a" id="u290a2c6a">，因此需要</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(N%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F44987cdf24dd308d34c4c7af30ad5b0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22We9WM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uebf2eeb3" id="uebf2eeb3">的额外内存空间。在实际 Transformer 模型中，序列长度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FjALI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1674ad1" id="ua1674ad1">通常远大于注意力头维度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa6a72c8dfd6d38dcc696da3b5bd22988.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qZuJB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue12d73c0" id="ue12d73c0">。这意味着中间注意力矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55fc237afbe535f7d8434985b848a6a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qzxlk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb8f829b" id="ubb8f829b">和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffd1905f6d4d60accedfa6b91be93ea9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vKoER%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u54180033" id="u54180033">的规模远大于输入矩阵</span></li><li fid="ubdc3618a" data-lake-id="ue2255b1d" id="ue2255b1d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ef27ae9" id="u5ef27ae9" style="color: #70000D">由于注意力计算中的部分或大部分操作属于内存受限操作，例如 Softmax，因此大量的 HBM 数据读写会直接导致实际墙钟运行时间增加。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue3aac34e" id="ue3aac34e">当注意力矩阵上还需要执行其他逐元素操作时，这一问题会进一步加剧。例如，需要对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55fc237afbe535f7d8434985b848a6a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i9PXl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21841dca" id="u21841dca">应用注意力掩码，或者对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ad7f899c1dacfd57bce71eaa5d79d2f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XFMaV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud881630c" id="ud881630c">执行 Dropout。每增加一个独立操作，都可能需要重新从 HBM 中读取注意力矩阵，并将结果再次写回 HBM</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua9d7eb68" id="ua9d7eb68" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1754615836377-813ee54e-6b7d-4739-9cbc-66c9b494b46b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u66100045-cad5-403b-b519-81ebb7b07f2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ube631734-c371-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A887%2C%22height%22%3A181%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A71821%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1557%2C%22originHeight%22%3A317%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22L%3ALOADQKBYBLOCKSFROMHBM%2CCOMPUTES%3DOK%2CWRITESTOHBM%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A130%2C%22width%22%3A1106%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REGUIRE%3AMATRICESQ%2CKVERWXDINHBM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A26%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A689%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%3ALOADPANDVBYBLOCKSFROMHBM%2CCOMPUTEO%3DPV%2CWRITEOTOHBM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A211%2C%22width%22%3A1150%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%3AREADSFROMHBM%2CCOMPUTEP%3DSOFTMAX(S)%2CWRITEPTOHBM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A172%2C%22width%22%3A1064%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AGORITHM0STANDARDATTENTIONIMPLEMENTATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A685%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224%3ARETURNO.%22%2C%22x%22%3A45%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A211%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e9e9e9%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jGGEI%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="is3nB" id="is3nB" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u425b0f04" id="u425b0f04">🐓</span><span data-lake-id="ub796c21e" id="ub796c21e"> 𝐓𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐑𝐞𝐜𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐮𝐭𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u72d6e8c0" id="u72d6e8c0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u047580a7" id="u047580a7">核心思想是将输入矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F27fc9cac17259612f01ac1f42db6120b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MM4FL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u41ffddb3" id="u41ffddb3">、</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Eufpv%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0bab7cfd" id="u0bab7cfd">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb80d3f0f4b3e62dbe1c8b3df5c4e7e37.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GOl11%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7b1ffcc7" id="u7b1ffcc7">划分为若干数据块，并将这些数据块从访问速度较慢的 HBM 加载至高速片上 SRAM。随后，在 SRAM 中逐块计算对应的注意力结果。通过在累加不同数据块的输出之前，使用正确的归一化因子对各块结果进行缩放，最终可以获得与标准注意力完全一致的精确输出</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ubf106b15" id="ubf106b15" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1785332149269-a8ab0a19-4255-42ce-b70c-b731d398303b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9734701d-ff7d-47ae-a92e-1991c9da123%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ua834afef-a287-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A608%2C%22height%22%3A362%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A426864%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1461%2C%22originHeight%22%3A871%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22NCHIP%2CCOMPUTEMPW%3DMAX(MI%2CIIJ)ERBR%2CCPEW%3DEI-MY%5C%22(%2BEMUI-%5C%22I%5C%22LERE%22%2C%22x%22%3A172%2C%22y%22%3A635%2C%22width%22%3A1058%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WRITEO%3B-DIAG(CPEW)-L(DIAG(C)EM-%5C%22%3AO%2BEMUI-IP%2C%2CV%2C)TOHBM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A143%2C%22y%22%3A677%2C%22width%22%3A995%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224%3ADIVIDEOINTOT%2CBLOCKSO..OR%2COFSIZEB%2CXDEACH%2CDIVIDEINTOTRBLOCKS.CROFSIZE%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A1315%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONCHP%2CCOMPUTEI%3B%3DROWMAX(SI%3B)ERR%2CP%3B%3DEXP(S%3B-MI%3B)ER6RXBE(POINTWISE).%22%2C%22x%22%3A145%2C%22y%22%3A553%2C%22width%22%3A1203%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLOCKSQ..%2CQROFSIZEB%2CXDEACH%2CANDDIVIDEK%2CVINTOT%3D%22%2C%22x%22%3A413%2C%22y%22%3A203%2C%22width%22%3A936%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOADQOITIFROMHBMTOON-CHIPSRAM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A135%2C%22y%22%3A468%2C%22width%22%3A662%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WXD%2CE%3D(0)NERN%2CM%3D(-O)NERNINHB%22%2C%22x%22%3A392%2C%22y%22%3A154%2C%22width%22%3A603%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XDINHBM%2CON-CHIPSRAMOFSIZEM%22%2C%22x%22%3A454%2C%22y%22%3A72%2C%22width%22%3A504%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KL...%2CKRANDVL%2C...%2CVT%2COFSIZEBCXDE%22%2C%22x%22%3A177%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A553%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BEACH%2CDIVIDEMINTOT%2CBLOCKSML..%2CMTOFSIZEB%2CEACH.%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A327%2C%22width%22%3A857%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REQUIRE%3AMATRICESQK%2CVERWXDIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A71%2C%22width%22%3A497%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GORITHM1FLASHATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A412%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WRITEC-EW%2CM%3B-M!EWTOHBM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A141%2C%22y%22%3A714%2C%22width%22%3A507%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%3AINITIALIZEO%3D(0)NXDERX%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A405%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CI%3B%3DROWSUM(PIJ)ERBR%22%2C%22x%22%3A147%2C%22y%22%3A592%2C%22width%22%3A385%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3ASETBLOCKSIZESB%3D%E6%80%A1%2CB%2C%3DMIN%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A111%2C%22width%22%3A510%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONCHIP%2CCOMPUTESI%3D0KERBRXE.%22%2C%22x%22%3A147%2C%22y%22%3A505%2C%22width%22%3A551%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226%3ALOADKV%3BFROMHBMTOON-CHIPSRAM.%22%2C%22x%22%3A39%2C%22y%22%3A397%2C%22width%22%3A651%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3ADIVIDEQINTOT%2C%3D%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A204%2C%22width%22%3A353%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3DMIN(%5B%2CD).%22%2C%22x%22%3A461%2C%22y%22%3A108%2C%22width%22%3A276%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226%3ARETURNO%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A823%2C%22width%22%3A175%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORL%3CI%3CTDO%22%2C%22x%22%3A82%2C%22y%22%3A431%2C%22width%22%3A368%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%3AENDFO%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A785%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22S%3AFOR1%3CJ%3CT.D0%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A360%2C%22width%22%3A278%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENDFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A93%2C%22y%22%3A750%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRXPCPOINTWISE).%22%2C%22x%22%3A1086%2C%22y%22%3A554%2C%22width%22%3A263%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A443%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A78%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%223%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A676%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A64%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227%3AFOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A530%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A51%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A718%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A68%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2211%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A632%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23efefef%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua15aa2de%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2d9476c1" id="u2d9476c1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3e5a5752" id="u3e5a5752" style="color: #270070">FlashAttention 以数据块为单位执行注意力计算。由于 Softmax 的归一化过程会同时关联</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2a44da316da48b0ab8fd154f1f9108c8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zKIE1%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6052317f" id="u6052317f" style="color: #270070">的所有列，因此不能简单地对各数据块独立计算 Softmax 后直接拼接。为解决这一问题，采用带缩放的分块 Softmax 分解方法</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u0c98f6f7" id="u0c98f6f7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5Cnm(x)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmax_i%20x_i%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5Cnf(x)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20e%5E%7Bx_1%20-%20m(x)%7D%20%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cldots%20%5C%5C%20e%5E%7Bx_B%20-%20m(x)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%5Cn%5C%5Cell(x)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Csum_i%20f(x)_i%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsoftmax%7D(x)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bf(x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cell(x)%7D.%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0a7c6bf56c75f52b084e73dbab5d94b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CArI1%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5f0e6d50"><li fid="u22e15c50" data-lake-id="ube1ccc0b" id="ube1ccc0b"><span data-lake-id="u9a395a12" id="u9a395a12">对于拼接向量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20%5B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%5D%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf8e1ae509d02667d28b445b731e8e29.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qv5L0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf694442f" id="uf694442f">，可通过维护统计量 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(m%2C%20%5C%5Cell)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0032d92efb08b7f8bcfd1e537b0462ef.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tVbUe%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u423a41fd" id="u423a41fd"> 增量计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub6d220d9" id="ub6d220d9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m(x)%20%3D%20m%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20x%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%5C%5C%20x%5E%7B(2)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%3D%20%5C%5Cmax%5C%5Cleft(%20m(x%5E%7B(1)%7D)%2C%20m(x%5E%7B(2)%7D)%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%5Cnf(x)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20e%5E%7Bm(x%5E%7B(1)%7D)%20-%20m(x)%7D%20f(x%5E%7B(1)%7D)%20%5C%5Cquad%20e%5E%7Bm(x%5E%7B(2)%7D)%20-%20m(x)%7D%20f(x%5E%7B(2)%7D)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F61fae4d068adba62eea51b3478c31f3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TyM5I%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ua82ead16" id="ua82ead16" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell(x)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cell%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20x%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%5C%5C%20x%5E%7B(2)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%3D%20e%5E%7Bm(x%5E%7B(1)%7D)%20-%20m(x)%7D%20%5C%5Cell(x%5E%7B(1)%7D)%20%5Cn%2B%20e%5E%7Bm(x%5E%7B(2)%7D)%20-%20m(x)%7D%20%5C%5Cell(x%5E%7B(2)%7D)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsoftmax%7D(x)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bf(x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cell(x)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a5d39e9092a3794aad1f1cf81eb9764.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t8pBW%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5bb66ed3"><li fid="u3db37079" data-lake-id="ud6b52b41" id="ud6b52b41"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d028a34" id="u3d028a34">只要在逐块计算过程中额外维护两个统计量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m(x)%2C%5C%5Cell(x)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F11d0c55bc816031d21047460c3765927.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lQh6i%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucbd2eceb" id="ucbd2eceb">就可以在不同时访问完整输入向量的情况下，逐块计算全局精确的 Softmax</span></strong></li><li fid="u3db37079" data-lake-id="u88e64c14" id="u88e64c14"><span data-lake-id="u18270d55" id="u18270d55">基于这一性质，FlashAttention 首先将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mB8mU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64719b23" id="u64719b23">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t4CgB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u07dd7c0d" id="u07dd7c0d">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb80d3f0f4b3e62dbe1c8b3df5c4e7e37.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mxHiI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9c01b030" id="u9c01b030">划分为多个数据块，对每个块计算局部 Softmax 结果及其附加统计量，随后利用更新后的最大值和归一化因子，对已有输出与当前块输出进行重新缩放和累加。经过所有数据块后，即可得到与标准注意力完全一致的输出</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u23e1716c" id="u23e1716c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u65902efd" id="u65902efd" style="color: #E4495B">FlashAttention 的另一个目标，是避免为反向传播保存</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(N%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F44987cdf24dd308d34c4c7af30ad5b0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UMIOj%22%7D" style="color: #E4495B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5f3f649d" id="u5f3f649d" style="color: #E4495B">规模的中间结果</span></strong></p><ul list="u332d51cf"><li fid="u3f68048c" data-lake-id="u735a075f" id="u735a075f"><span data-lake-id="u1a4a29b8" id="u1a4a29b8">在标准注意力实现中，为计算关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22spCws%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9bf5df19" id="u9bf5df19">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XOrC8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucdc97ab7" id="ucdc97ab7">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb80d3f0f4b3e62dbe1c8b3df5c4e7e37.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vQn2T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue36ccbe5" id="ue36ccbe5">的梯度，反向传播通常需要使用前向传播中生成的矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S%2CP%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbfbbf34440397ef4c11c9a14644589db.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AnDma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3b77456b" id="u3b77456b">如果在前向传播过程中将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55fc237afbe535f7d8434985b848a6a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rn0V3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3076f2af" id="u3076f2af">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffd1905f6d4d60accedfa6b91be93ea9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZLVGH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud9b6a593" id="ud9b6a593">完整保存至 HBM，就会产生随序列长度平方增长的内存开销</span></li><li fid="u3f68048c" data-lake-id="u0261272a" id="u0261272a"><span data-lake-id="u13cf57ad" id="u13cf57ad">FlashAttention 只保存最终输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa946bfe2d39be198589a4de189e0f670.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZmByf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubc669f0e" id="ubc669f0e">以及 Softmax 的归一化统计量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(m%2C%5C%5Cell).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56ff7f92d22e41c178c6418bbbc58e33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G40xj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua99f863c" id="ua99f863c">在反向传播过程中，算法再次将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WQ2Ib%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u545aa762" id="u545aa762">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QXihR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2afc5fa4" id="u2afc5fa4">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb80d3f0f4b3e62dbe1c8b3df5c4e7e37.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ddq7I%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uea3b9ff3" id="uea3b9ff3">的数据块加载至 SRAM，并利用这些输入数据和已保存的统计量，在片上重新计算相应的数据块。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f3c8e9c" id="u2f3c8e9c">因此，反向传播所需的注意力矩阵可以按块即时重建，无须将完整的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%5C%5Ctimes%20N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F33913e46e9446e4390959a6d52f0f23f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r2BDL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u76e4afc5" id="u76e4afc5">中间矩阵存储在 HBM 中</span></strong></li><li fid="u3f68048c" data-lake-id="u069cff68" id="u069cff68"><span data-lake-id="udad28ef2" id="udad28ef2">可以视为一种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u06d87c58" id="u06d87c58">选择性梯度检查点</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u02bff422" id="u02bff422">。传统梯度检查点方法通过在反向传播中重新执行部分前向计算来降低峰值内存占用，但通常需要以更长的运行时间作为代价。与传统方法不同，FlashAttention 的重计算虽然增加浮点运算次数，却减少大量昂贵的 HBM 数据访问。因此，其反向传播过程不仅更加节省内存，在实际运行中反而更加快速</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="OImP6" id="OImP6" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ubdcd3125" id="ubdcd3125">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="u696b8eb0" id="u696b8eb0"> 𝐅𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐡𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-𝟐: 𝐅𝐚𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐫 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐁𝐞𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐫 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐦 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐭𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u7f9303ad" id="u7f9303ad"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub19caab5" id="ub19caab5">FlashAttention 利用 GPU 非对称的存储层次结构，在不引入任何近似的情况下，显著降低内存开销。将其由二次复杂度降至线性复杂度——并相较于经过优化的基线实现获得 2–4 倍的运行速度提升</span></strong></p><ul list="u926f791e"><li fid="u53f90cee" data-lake-id="u637d52ba" id="u637d52ba"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0d0e737b" id="u0d0e737b" style="color: #E4495B">与经过高度优化的矩阵乘法（GEMM）操作相比，FlashAttention 的运行效率仍存在明显差距，其实际吞吐率仅达到理论峰值 FLOPs/s 的 25%–40%</span></strong></li><li fid="u53f90cee" data-lake-id="ue79f9ac1" id="ue79f9ac1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5462093e" id="u5462093e" style="color: #5C0036">FlashAttention 在 GPU 不同线程块和线程束之间的任务划分仍然不够合理，从而导致 GPU 占用率不足，或者产生不必要的共享内存读写操作</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u80f6cd85" id="u80f6cd85"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4d44baf5" id="u4d44baf5">提出 FlashAttention-2，通过改进任务划分方式进一步提升计算效率</span></strong></p><ul list="uda69250c"><li fid="u3aaf5cc7" data-lake-id="u6c0836e9" id="u6c0836e9"><span data-lake-id="u1a0372b8" id="u1a0372b8">第一，调整算法以减少非矩阵乘法浮点运算的数量</span></li><li fid="u3aaf5cc7" data-lake-id="uadd74a2f" id="uadd74a2f"><span data-lake-id="uece3b069" id="uece3b069">第二，即使对于单个注意力头，也将注意力计算并行分配至不同线程块，以提高 GPU 占用率</span></li><li fid="u3aaf5cc7" data-lake-id="u9a6d7835" id="u9a6d7835"><span data-lake-id="ued2f9761" id="ued2f9761">第三，在线程块内部重新划分不同线程束之间的任务，以减少通过共享内存进行的通信</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="METfB" id="METfB" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1c076090" id="u1c076090"> </span><span data-lake-id="uc0e24c25" id="uc0e24c25">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="u32426955" id="u32426955"> 𝐁𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue6cb6bcb" id="ue6cb6bcb"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud14b16dd" id="ud14b16dd">GPU 性能特征：GPU 由计算单元（例如浮点运算单元）和存储层次结构组成。大多数现代 GPU 都包含用于加速低精度矩阵乘法的专用计算单元，例如 NVIDIA GPU 中用于 FP16/BF16 矩阵乘法的 Tensor Core</span></strong></p><ul list="uf0629bb8"><li fid="u824eec14" data-lake-id="u0e852806" id="u0e852806"><span data-lake-id="u747a4fa2" id="u747a4fa2">GPU 的存储层次结构主要包括高带宽显存 HBM 和片上 SRAM，即共享内存。以 A100 GPU 为例，其配备 40–80 GB 的 HBM，带宽为 1.5–2.0 TB/s；同时，A100 包含 108 个流式多处理器，每个 SM 配备 192 KB 的片上 SRAM，其总带宽估计约为 19 TB/s</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u90485288" id="u90485288"><strong><span data-lake-id="u79eaa600" id="u79eaa600">执行模型：GPU 包含大量线程，用于并行执行某项操作，该操作通常称为一个计算内核。线程被组织为多个线程块（thread block），线程块由 GPU 调度至不同的流式多处理器上执行</span></strong></p><ul list="ud46aea81"><li fid="ubb4e0c28" data-lake-id="u86342818" id="u86342818"><span data-lake-id="u755dabfb" id="u755dabfb">在线程块内部，线程进一步被划分为线程束（warp），每个线程束包含 32 个线程。同一线程束内的线程可以通过高效的 shuffle 指令交换数据，也可以协同执行矩阵乘法。位于同一线程块中的不同线程束，则可以通过读写共享内存进行通信</span></li><li fid="ubb4e0c28" data-lake-id="ue1c0f3b3" id="ue1c0f3b3"><span data-lake-id="u8a9f0c19" id="u8a9f0c19">每个计算内核首先将输入数据从 HBM 加载至寄存器和 SRAM，随后执行计算，最后将输出结果写回 HBM</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u965d9483" id="u965d9483"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7b5925e6" id="u7b5925e6">标准注意力实现：给定输入序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%2CK%2CV%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2ce57be00010151774547658ab86f24a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sERAp%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u24b5f478" id="u24b5f478">，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F472c93d29dce3da21900c71604613d75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xwHPT%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud704b8e2" id="ud704b8e2">表示序列长度，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OVKNK%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua9943059" id="ua9943059">表示注意力头维度，希望计算注意力输出</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20O%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34460204ab6a9eba64ef8243574e5612.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BVwDr%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u8f4811b6" id="u8f4811b6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQK%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsoftmax%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BPV%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F99a502be1523e4fc8e03c3cdb96608c4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iwrrL%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uba2399ca"><li fid="u9cd751b5" data-lake-id="ucf6f28a6" id="ucf6f28a6"><span data-lake-id="u91633e0b" id="u91633e0b">其中 Softmax 按行计算。对于多头注意力，上述计算会在多个注意力头之间并行执行，同时也会沿批次维度并行</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc2ea03bf" id="uc2ea03bf"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8a1a9b5b" id="u8a1a9b5b">注意力机制的反向传播过程：设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dO%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5604db754a50e9a340c65892645d12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22In3hm%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1603b33d" id="u1603b33d">表示某一损失函数关于输出</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa946bfe2d39be198589a4de189e0f670.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ws3tN%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uce702e3b" id="uce702e3b">的梯度。根据链式法则，即反向传播</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u18f2ddb5" id="u18f2ddb5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Balign%7D%5Cnd%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnd%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%20%26%3D%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnd%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bdsoftmax%7D(d%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D)%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnd%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%20%26%3D%20d%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnd%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7Dd%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Balign%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F675c32652dd44b3a49c7895ca52054dd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oUoLN%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u48bc4443" id="u48bc4443"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubbdf4b0e" id="ubbdf4b0e">标准注意力的实现过程：首先调用矩阵乘法（GEMM）子程序计算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S%3DQK%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5f70e7ca619a761ce6a90ebea08af220.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XL59T%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u79b339a9" id="u79b339a9">，并将结果写入 HBM；随后从 HBM 中加载 S，计算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftmax%7D(S)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1808caa1d8b67d84b0a3885516dc04c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JgH9O%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u98d0a273" id="u98d0a273">，并将结果 P 写回 HBM；最后，再次调用 GEMM 计算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O%3DPV%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F888e1b4872e97c21b8869be52fa27ed3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NkP3g%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u209cfe0f"><li fid="ua6b3b666" data-lake-id="uc57bf70e" id="uc57bf70e"><span data-lake-id="u16b54413" id="u16b54413">其中大多数操作受内存带宽限制，大量内存访问会导致较长的实际运行时间。由于必须显式生成并存储 S 和 P，标准注意力的内存复杂度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(N%5E2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F44987cdf24dd308d34c4c7af30ad5b0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22co65j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5042b6e4" id="u5042b6e4">。同时，为在反向传播过程中计算梯度，还必须保存</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%5C%5Ctimes%20N%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe4c627d8c96413cff4f64f3582d5c49b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hkc43%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube79b62d" id="ube79b62d">，从而进一步增加训练阶段的显存开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud52af20b" id="ud52af20b"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud993433e" id="ud993433e" style="color: #5C0036">FlashAttention 采用经典的分块计算（tiling）技术减少内存 I/O。首先将输入数据块从 HBM 加载至 SRAM，随后基于当前数据块计算注意力，并直接更新输出，而无须将大型中间矩阵 S 和 P 写入 HBM</span></strong></p><ul list="uce26f9df"><li fid="u4b8d1abb" data-lake-id="uf10e2fe2" id="uf10e2fe2"><span data-lake-id="ud2e89367" id="ud2e89367">由于 Softmax 的归一化过程会关联整行或整个行块，online softmax 可以将注意力计算划分为多个数据块，并在处理不同数据块时对输出进行重新缩放，最终得到完全正确的结果，而不引入任何近似</span></li><li fid="u4b8d1abb" data-lake-id="u6e42a176" id="u6e42a176"><span data-lake-id="u51245411" id="u51245411">标准 Softmax 的计算过程</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaf945723" id="uaf945723" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cnm%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmax%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browmax%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(S%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browmax%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(S%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cell%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browsum%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7BS%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%7D%5C%5Cright)%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browsum%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7BS%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnP%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5BP%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5C%3BP%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cell)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cleft%5Be%5E%7BS%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%7D%5C%5C%3Be%5E%7BS%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%5C%5Ctimes%202B_c%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnO%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5BP%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5C%3BP%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7DV%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5CV%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cell)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7BS%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%7DV%5E%7B(1)%7D%2Be%5E%7BS%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%7DV%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9fb3ff46989a17f6b0225d43eae60320.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y0GN2%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uce26f9df" start="3"><li fid="u4b8d1abb" data-lake-id="ua911d93b" id="ua911d93b"><span data-lake-id="u5fe63437" id="u5fe63437">在线 Softmax 则分别针对每个数据块计算局部 Softmax，并通过重新缩放得到最终的精确输出</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua20d6173" id="ua20d6173" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cnm%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browmax%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(S%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browsum%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7BS%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%5E%7B(1)%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cwidetilde%7BP%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7De%5E%7BS%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%5E%7B(1)%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%5C%5Ctimes%20B_c%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnO%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cwidetilde%7BP%7D%5E%7B(1)%7DV%5E%7B(1)%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7De%5E%7BS%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%5E%7B(1)%7D%7DV%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnm%5E%7B(2)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmax%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(m%5E%7B(1)%7D%2C%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browmax%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(S%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%3Dm%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D%20%26%3D%20e%5E%7Bm%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%5E%7B(2)%7D%7D%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(1)%7D%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browsum%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7BS%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%5E%7B(2)%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browsum%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7BS%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%7D%5C%5Cright)%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browsum%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7BS%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%7D%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Cell%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cwidetilde%7BP%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7De%5E%7BS%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%5E%7B(2)%7D%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%5C%5Ctimes%20B_c%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5CnO%5E%7B(2)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(1)%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)e%5E%7Bm%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%5E%7B(2)%7D%7DO%5E%7B(1)%7D%2B%5C%5Cwidetilde%7BP%7D%5E%7B(2)%7DV%5E%7B(2)%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7De%5E%7BS%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%7DV%5E%7B(1)%7D%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7De%5E%7BS%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%7DV%5E%7B(2)%7D%3DO.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F546bfe4ace7ad65f75e915269244e3c5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LSdwP%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9e56e351" id="u9e56e351" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1762003524193-69f3d641-bf1b-45e6-b1a4-cfe8b0f08442.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u76e797fa-0d67-45a1-bedd-00150b07ef1%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ufde4d4c8-cd50-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A656.0875244140625%2C%22height%22%3A340%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A103835%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A986%2C%22originHeight%22%3A511%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPUTEDINSRAM%22%2C%22x%22%3A81%2C%22y%22%3A372%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SD%3DQ(K(D)%22%2C%22x%22%3A249%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SA%3D0(K2)%22%2C%22x%22%3A382%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3