E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A361%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(2)%22%2C%22x%22%3A604%2C%22y%22%3A391%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A(1%22%2C%22x%22%3A773%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(1%E4%BA%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A240%2C%22y%22%3A458%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(1)%22%2C%22x%22%3A816%2C%22y%22%3A316%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fdfcfc%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u28da7ee8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="HWc6x" id="HWc6x" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u5b8f177b" id="u5b8f177b">🫎</span><span data-lake-id="u648cb8fd" id="u648cb8fd"> 𝐅𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐡𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-𝟐</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5cfe59ba" id="u5cfe59ba"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf17656d9" id="uf17656d9">对 FlashAttention 的算法进行调整，以减少非矩阵乘法浮点运算的数量。这是因为现代 GPU 配备专门的计算单元，例如 NVIDIA GPU 上的 Tensor Core，可以显著加速矩阵乘法。重新审视上述在线 Softmax 技术，并对其进行两项小幅调整，以减少非矩阵乘法 FLOPs</span></strong></p><ul list="u4586abb0"><li fid="u2cbcade5" data-lake-id="ue3e3f111" id="ue3e3f111"><span data-lake-id="u21f6b1df" id="u21f6b1df">在更新输出时，无须使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62ad937183263d3fb425ccb607f664a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m4gkb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf8777131" id="uf8777131">分别缩放两个输出项。原始更新过程表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6cbe8ef8" id="u6cbe8ef8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%20O%5E%7B(2)%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(1)%7D%2F%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cbig)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20O%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%5C%5C%3B%2B%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cbig)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5C%2Ce%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20S%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%5E%7B(2)%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20V%5E%7B(2)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e6de8d7a35d8e00dc5d56978e2ab003.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fD9rR%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u720e10cc"><li fid="u888172f9" data-lake-id="ud005144e" id="ud005144e"><span data-lake-id="ue37f2d89" id="ue37f2d89">作为替代，可以维护</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O%5E%7B(2)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F41e1602957448a5e0a338032a95041cd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KRRMG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u53e9d115" id="u53e9d115">的一个未缩放版本，并同时保留统计量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F01e01e178dce8918992a1fb72d18e81b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cxTd7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u11d12b0d" id="u11d12b0d">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue98f95a8" id="ue98f95a8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7BO%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7DO%5E%7B(1)%7D%2Be%5E%7BS%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%5E%7B(2)%7D%7DV%5E%7B(2)%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc360d259ec19e3e51ca69cfde4291dc7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hr43S%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3dab7ca7"><li fid="u94b544d2" data-lake-id="uff0f77f2" id="uff0f77f2"><span data-lake-id="u28e6c193" id="u28e6c193">仅在循环全部结束后，才使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blast%7D)%7D)%5E%7B-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8b9a62c7a231c687c5ff52ade822b3a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NhT6U%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub0fe05b0" id="ub0fe05b0">对最终的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7BO%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blast%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F64c0ed9742ebe262494058fa5c3ae353.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QGcWL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42ea5c30" id="u42ea5c30">进行缩放，从而得到正确的输出</span></li><li fid="u94b544d2" data-lake-id="u92969d34" id="u92969d34"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub253a2dc" id="ub253a2dc" style="color: #E4495B">在反向传播过程中，无须同时保存最大值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%5E%7B(j)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F73535370a3d6d70acb9b1730da9e4215.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X5bgL%22%7D" style="color: #E4495B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u32a52c10" id="u32a52c10" style="color: #E4495B">和指数和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(j)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6b2879383a6eca3343169ecf440a21c0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UWvp7%22%7D" style="color: #E4495B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucd3bbdb1" id="ucd3bbdb1" style="color: #E4495B">，只需保存二者对应的 LogSumExp 统计量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%5E%7B(j)%7D%3Dm%5E%7B(j)%7D%2B%5C%5Clog(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(j)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F261d8ec63290ef32aeefa91eef7f7976.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S52oH%22%7D" style="color: #E4495B"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3ab23f7d" id="u3ab23f7d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cnm%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browmax%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browsum%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%5E%7B(1)%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%20%26%3D%20e%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%5E%7B(1)%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB_r%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cnm%5E%7B(2)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmax%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(m%5E%7B(1)%7D%2C%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browmax%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%3Dm%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D%20%26%3D%20e%5E%7Bm%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%5E%7B(2)%7D%7D%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(1)%7D%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browsum%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%5E%7B(2)%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browsum%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%7D%5C%5Cright)%2B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Browsum%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%7D%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Cell%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7De%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%5E%7B(2)%7D%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(e%5E%7Bm%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%5E%7B(2)%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%2Be%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%5E%7B(2)%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%3De%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D-m%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B(1)%7D%2Be%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D-m%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cell%5E%7B(2)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D%7D%5E%7B(2)%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BO%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F87e4f472c6bd39b7909cef91082cc7fd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xWfeg%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5117a127" id="u5117a127"><strong><span data-lake-id="u083618b4" id="u083618b4">因果掩码：注意力机制的一种常见应用是自回归语言建模。需要对注意力矩阵 S 施加因果掩码，即将所有满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20j%3Ei%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3513388c2f2448d1269ef9253be340b7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f3G5u%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub48711fd" id="ub48711fd">的元素</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_%7Bij%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F69130b29a49187039cf667090dac8caa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RI6nh%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a4ffdd5" id="u9a4ffdd5">设置为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20-%5C%5Cinfty%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5d69947f44506e87f590e61bf4096d3c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22I7RFW%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud45f6627"><li fid="u618ea547" data-lake-id="u53b74489" id="u53b74489"><span data-lake-id="u740f8f70" id="u740f8f70">由于 FlashAttention 和 FlashAttention-2 均采用分块计算，对于块内所有列索引都大于行索引的注意力块，可以直接跳过整个块的计算。当序列长度较大时，这类块约占全部注意力块的一半。因此，与不使用因果掩码的注意力计算相比，该方法可实现约 1.7–1.8 倍的加速</span></li><li fid="u618ea547" data-lake-id="uc6092ac2" id="uc6092ac2"><span data-lake-id="ubd148150" id="ubd148150">对于行索引均严格大于列索引的注意力块，无须在块内部施加因果掩码。因此，在采用方形数据块的情况下，每个行块仅需对一个位于主对角线上的数据块执行因果掩码操作</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u85523b49" id="u85523b49"><strong><span data-lake-id="u22f3b340" id="u22f3b340">与 FlashAttention 相同，在不引入任何近似的情况下，能够返回正确的注意力输出</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftmax%7D(QK%5E%5C%5Ctop)V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb498a2f79f737b063972b5c8134fcadf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oVv2K%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u92067659" id="u92067659">。该算法需要</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(N%5E2d)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3ee67ef7bde7c855085500bed1dd12d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S0IGc%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u63eb37d0" id="u63eb37d0">次浮点运算；除输入和输出外，仅需</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O(N)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8c51f5913186f8ac629f1d5838940f33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fy8WA%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u95eb68e4" id="u95eb68e4">的额外内存，用于保存 LogSumExp 统计量</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u7e6541e8" id="u7e6541e8"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc4ed414b" id="uc4ed414b">多查询注意力和分组查询注意力是两种注意力变体。在这两种机制中，多个查询头共享同一个键头和值头，从而减小推理阶段 KV Cache 的存储规模。在实际计算中，无须显式复制键头和值头，而是通过隐式调整注意力头索引完成等价计算。在反向传播阶段，则需要对这些被隐式复制到不同查询头的键和值梯度进行求和，即跨相关注意力头累加</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dK%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbabdc9e0e0383504466e9c04f0302c44.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QawUg%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u38aa701b" id="u38aa701b">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dV%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd45aac7363d62a8e3bf118573891e402.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D6a4P%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="mG6RQ" id="mG6RQ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u128b69a4" id="u128b69a4">🦜</span><span data-lake-id="ua050f5a6" id="ua050f5a6"> 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐥𝐥𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐦</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u94c53741" id="u94c53741"><strong><span data-lake-id="u773732e3" id="u773732e3">沿序列长度维度并行：FlashAttention 主要沿批量大小和注意力头数量两个维度进行并行。对于每个注意力头，使用一个线程块进行处理，因此线程块总数为 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7Bbatch%20size%7D%5C%5Ctimes%5C%5Ctext%7Bnumber%20of%20heads%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F862ee12522ada7cf334a37083a55e655.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KR8N8%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubd1b77aa" id="ubd1b77aa">。每个线程块会被调度到一个流式多处理器上运行</span></strong></p><ul list="ua9087ee8"><li fid="ub836aa21" data-lake-id="ue427a632" id="ue427a632"><span data-lake-id="u0056a42c" id="u0056a42c">对于长序列场景，批量大小或注意力头数量通常较小。为更充分地利用 GPU 上的流式多处理器，FlashAttention-2 进一步沿序列长度维度进行并行，从而在此类场景下获得显著加速</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0989d141" id="u0989d141"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufb57c771" id="ufb57c771">在前向传播中，沿序列长度展开的外层循环具有天然的并行性，因此可以将不同迭代调度到彼此独立的线程块上执行，且这些线程块之间无须通信。与此同时，FlashAttention-2 仍然保留原始 FlashAttention 中沿批次维度和注意力头维度的并行方式</span></strong></p><ul list="u167f2828"><li fid="u87b8e0ad" data-lake-id="ub21c2553" id="ub21c2553"><span data-lake-id="ua7e234d5" id="ua7e234d5">当批量大小和注意力头数量较小时，沿序列长度维度增加的并行性能够提升 GPU 占用率，即提高实际被利用的 GPU 资源比例，从而在此类场景下带来性能提升</span></li><li fid="u87b8e0ad" data-lake-id="u70d17385" id="u70d17385"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf2a2e4cf" id="uf2a2e4cf" style="color: #5C0036">将循环顺序调整为外层遍历行块、内层遍历列块，而不是采用原始 FlashAttention 论文中相反的循环顺序，以及沿序列长度维度进行并行，这两项思路最早由 Phil Tillet 在 Triton 实现中提出并实现</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u361d94c9" id="u361d94c9"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua1e56ece" id="ua1e56ece">反向传播同样沿序列长度维度进行并行，并为每个列块分配一个线程块。不同线程块在更新</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22dQ%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faa1993381d28f17d9e4604e1abf2103f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b8HSr%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u083400bf" id="u083400bf">时，通过原子加法进行通信</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="BRKKj" id="BRKKj" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4178476c" id="u4178476c">🐳</span><span data-lake-id="u621b24fe" id="u621b24fe"> 𝐖𝐨𝐫𝐤 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐭𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐁𝐞𝐭𝐰𝐞𝐞𝐧 𝐖𝐚𝐫𝐩𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u3cef1fb2" id="u3cef1fb2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8e8a18f2" id="u8e8a18f2">前向传播：对于每个计算块，FlashAttention 将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XIKIO%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8af44e3d" id="u8af44e3d">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WsT8o%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0ff25b1e" id="u0ff25b1e">划分给 4 个线程束，同时使所有线程束均可访问</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ihChI%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6b24473" id="ub6b24473">。每个线程束首先通过矩阵乘法计算</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22QK%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe8543a14174f23603bc545d16da1beac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VIrrv%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue5c5c2c0" id="ue5c5c2c0">的一个分片，随后再与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MdJGo%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7862f388" id="u7862f388">的相应分片相乘，并通过通信将各线程束的计算结果累加起来。这种方式称为 split-K 方案</span></strong></p><ul list="u9b38a0d1"><li fid="u02de1922" data-lake-id="u4f9c73ca" id="u4f9c73ca"><span data-lake-id="u8872138d" id="u8872138d">​</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue388361d" id="ue388361d">split-K 方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf5733bea" id="uf5733bea">的效率较低，因为所有线程束都需要将各自的中间结果写入共享内存，完成同步后，再对这些中间结果进行累加。频繁的共享内存读写会降低 FlashAttention 前向传播的执行速度</span></li><li fid="u02de1922" data-lake-id="u52003833" id="u52003833"><span data-lake-id="ub77c0126" id="ub77c0126">在 FlashAttention-2 中，改为将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F27fc9cac17259612f01ac1f42db6120b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QQ6Y6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue14b1ec3" id="ue14b1ec3">划分给 4 个线程束，同时使所有线程束均可访问</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cyVf1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u85d10540" id="u85d10540">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pAoir%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4ea10cff" id="u4ea10cff">。每个线程束通过矩阵乘法得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20QK%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F596cd78975a3b5e16e033782ae5cf2c4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LhHqq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28e46e4f" id="u28e46e4f">的一个分片后，只需将其与所有线程束共享访问的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22naWEv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0828513b" id="u0828513b">相乘，即可得到对应的输出分片。整个过程中不再需要线程束之间的通信</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaeab054d" id="uaeab054d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua749072e" id="ua749072e">在反向传播中，同样采用避免 split-K 方案的线程束划分方式。然而，由于输入和梯度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%2CK%2CV%2CO%2CdO%2CdQ%2CdK%2CdV%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8800f1dba1ad71c4a34ef0e497b7a791.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XRgJR%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u73bfef8c" id="u73bfef8c">之间具有更加复杂的依赖关系，计算过程中仍然需要执行一定程度的同步操作</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4809695e" id="u4809695e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7c2bea25" id="u7c2bea25">数据块大小调优：增大数据块尺寸通常能够减少共享内存的加载和存储次数，但同时也会增加所需的寄存器数量和共享内存总量。当数据块尺寸超过一定范围后，寄存器溢出会导致显著的性能下降；或者，所需共享内存可能超过 GPU 能够提供的容量，使计算内核无法运行</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5f500e00" id="u5f500e00" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1762005338069-3426d8f9-6f56-4289-9981-2f0bfd169361.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u508f8a7a-a963-4521-a354-d20bb9f08bc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u37891e78-2d8d-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A765.0909090909091%2C%22height%22%3A284%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A85812%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1052%2C%22originHeight%22%3A390%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22(AFLASHATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A175%2C%22y%22%3A354%2C%22width%22%3A204%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B)FLASHATTENTION-2%22%2C%22x%22%3A703%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A225%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SPLITACROSSDIFFERENTWARP%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACCESSEDBYALLWARPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A633%2C%22y%22%3A295%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PLITACROSSDIFFERENTWARPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A636%2C%22y%22%3A326%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ACCESSEDBYALLWARPS%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP4%22%2C%22x%22%3A399%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP1-4%22%2C%22x%22%3A104%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22---%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A478%2C%22y%22%3A223%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP3%22%2C%22x%22%3A476%2C%22y%22%3A203%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP1%22%2C%22x%22%3A196%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP1-4%22%2C%22x%22%3A975%2C%22y%22%3A163%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP3%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A212%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP1-4%22%2C%22x%22%3A822%2C%22y%22%3A54%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP2%22%2C%22x%22%3A477%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP3%22%2C%22x%22%3A334%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP2%22%2C%22x%22%3A664%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22----%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A200%2C%22y%22%3A41%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP4%22%2C%22x%22%3A668%2C%22y%22%3A261%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP2%22%2C%22x%22%3A272%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP4%22%2C%22x%22%3A477%2C%22y%22%3A247%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP1%22%2C%22x%22%3A670%2C%22y%22%3A118%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARP1%22%2C%22x%22%3A479%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AAAAAAAAAAIIIIIAIAI%22%2C%22x%22%3A833%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A478%2C%22y%22%3A179%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A285%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A259%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80--%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A188%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A650%2C%22y%22%3A277%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbf9f7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22udb2556c0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="gy713" id="gy713" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uec933319" id="uec933319">🐶</span><span data-lake-id="u3da1debd" id="u3da1debd"> 𝐅𝐥𝐚𝐬𝐡𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧-𝟑: 𝐅𝐚𝐬𝐭 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐀𝐜𝐜𝐮𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐞 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐀𝐬𝐲𝐧𝐜𝐡𝐫𝐨𝐧𝐲 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐋𝐨𝐰-𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uad3621b6" id="uad3621b6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6c27cb14" id="u6c27cb14">本文建立在 FlashAttention 系列工作的基础之上，其核心思想是在高层算法设计阶段显式考虑 GPU 的执行模型和硬件特性，从而实现精确 Attention 的高效计算</span></strong></p><ul list="u624b94ae"><li fid="ub35514d2" data-lake-id="u1d7470d8" id="u1d7470d8"><span data-lake-id="uca069724" id="uca069724" style="color: #000000">FlashAttention 最初提出一种面向 Attention 的新型分块策略，通过将 Attention 中的多个操作融合到单个 GPU Kernel 中，避免中间结果频繁读写低速的全局显存，从而显著降低内存访问开销</span></li><li fid="ub35514d2" data-lake-id="u4e03ef4a" id="u4e03ef4a"><span data-lake-id="u5098545d" id="u5098545d">FlashAttention-2 对原始算法进行进一步重构，使其能够沿 Sequence Length 维度进行并行，并在 Forward Pass 的内部循环中依次处理 Key 和 Value 矩阵的数据块，从而提高 GPU 的 Occupancy，并改善计算任务在 GPU 上的分配方式</span></li><li fid="ub35514d2" data-lake-id="uc3428071" id="uc3428071"><span data-lake-id="ude79c3ac" id="ude79c3ac">与经过高度优化的矩阵乘法 Kernel 相比，FlashAttention-2 在新一代 GPU 上的硬件利用率仍然较低。例如，在 Hopper H100 GPU 上，FlashAttention-2 的硬件利用率约为 35%，而优化后的 GEMM Kernel 通常可以达到 80%–90%</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaa259229" id="uaa259229"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6d89e050" id="u6d89e050" style="color: #000000">这一差距部分来源于实现层面的差异。例如，在面向 Tensor Core 编程时，FlashAttention-2 并未充分采用 Hopper 架构特有的指令，而仍然沿用部分面向 Ampere 架构的执行方式。已有工作表明，通过使用 Hopper 专用指令以及基于 Tile 的编程抽象，可以同时提升 Attention 的计算性能并简化 Kernel 实现</span></strong></p><ul list="u40150e54"><li fid="u252ffc52" data-lake-id="ubdeff439" id="ubdeff439"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc61e389f" id="uc61e389f" style="color: #DF2A3F">更为根本的问题在于，FlashAttention-2 的算法设计仍然遵循一种相对简化的同步执行模型，并未在算法层面显式利用异步执行和低精度计算能力</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf3b87f9f" id="uf3b87f9f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c20528c" id="u1c20528c">异步执行能力来源于现代 GPU 针对机器学习核心工作负载所进行的硬件专用化。例如，矩阵乘法可以由专门的 Tensor Core 执行，而数据搬运则可以交由 Tensor Memory Accelerator（TMA） 完成；这些硬件单元可以与执行逻辑运算、整数运算和普通浮点运算的 CUDA Core 相互独立地工作</span></strong></p><ul list="u0355f124"><li fid="u033d3ac1" data-lake-id="u7177c5df" id="u7177c5df"><span data-lake-id="uf9ae464c" id="uf9ae464c">低精度计算也是提升 GPU 吞吐率的重要技术路径。从 Pascal 架构中的 FP16、Ampere 架构中的 BF16，到 Hopper 架构中的 FP8，再到 Blackwell 架构中的 FP4，GPU 不断引入更低精度的数据格式。在相同功耗和芯片面积条件下，这些低精度数据格式通常可以获得约两倍甚至四倍的计算吞吐率</span></li><li fid="u033d3ac1" data-lake-id="u82895233" id="u82895233"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf8a78c2e" id="uf8a78c2e" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">FlashAttention-3 面临的核心技术挑战，是重新设计 FlashAttention-2，使其能够充分利用现代 GPU 的异步执行能力和低精度 Tensor Core。其中，异步执行要求在 Matrix Multiplication 和 Softmax 之间实现计算重叠，尽管 Softmax 本身依赖于 GEMM 的输出；而低精度计算则需要谨慎控制量化误差，特别是在 LLM 激活中存在显著离群特征的情况下</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4256deac" id="u4256deac"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3a03e76" id="ub3a03e76">作者提出 FlashAttention-3，通过综合以下三项关键技术进一步提升新一代 GPU 架构上的 Attention 性能</span></strong></p><ul list="u2fc4fc04"><li fid="ub43a7357" data-lake-id="u81f9cb1c" id="u81f9cb1c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u63bd1937" id="u63bd1937">生产者-消费者异步执行（Producer-Consumer Asynchrony）：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ued42c901" id="ued42c901" style="color: #5C0036">设计一种基于 Warp 专门化（Warp Specialization） 的软件流水线机制，通过将数据的生产者与消费者划分至不同的 Warp，充分利用数据搬运与 Tensor Core 计算的异步执行能力，从而进一步增强算法隐藏内存访问延迟和指令发射延迟的能力</span></strong></li><li fid="ub43a7357" data-lake-id="ufa1de03a" id="ufa1de03a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u761e2a61" id="u761e2a61">利用异步分块 GEMM 隐藏 Softmax 开销（Hiding Softmax under Asynchronous Block-wise GEMMs）：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ua23853ca" id="ua23853ca" style="color: #5C0036">Softmax 中包含浮点乘加、指数运算等吞吐率相对较低的非 GEMM 操作。将这些操作与用于 GEMM 计算的异步 WGMMA 指令进行重叠执行。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2a8a8490" id="u2a8a8490">重新设计 FlashAttention-2 算法，以规避 Softmax 与 GEMM 之间的部分串行依赖。例如，在两阶段版本的算法中，当 Softmax 正在处理 Score Matrix 的一个 Block 时，WGMMA 可以同时通过异步执行机制计算下一个 Block，从而实现 Softmax 与 GEMM 的流水线重叠</span></li><li fid="ub43a7357" data-lake-id="u30bf901a" id="u30bf901a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u70220941" id="u70220941">硬件加速的低精度 GEMM（Hardware-accelerated Low-precision GEMM）：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u21ca4ce8" id="u21ca4ce8" style="color: #5C0036">对前向传播算法进行适配，使 GEMM 能够直接利用 FP8 Tensor Core 执行，从而使实测 TFLOPs/s 几乎提升一倍。实现这一目标需要解决 WGMMA 对不同数据布局的约束，即协调 FP32 Accumulator Block 与 FP8 Operand Matrix Block 在内存布局上的不同要求。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ude7b6b14" id="ude7b6b14">采用分块量化（Block Quantization）和非相干处理（Incoherent Processing）技术，以减轻由计算精度降低至 FP8 所导致的数值精度损失</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="vhWyf" id="vhWyf" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="uba8e839a" id="uba8e839a">🐡</span><span data-lake-id="ua7e2e152" id="ua7e2e152"> 𝐁𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝: 𝐌𝐮𝐥𝐭𝐢-𝐇𝐞𝐚𝐝 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐆𝐏𝐔 𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐜𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐜𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u4b52c360" id="u4b52c360"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0a113426" id="u0a113426" style="color: #70000D">GPU 的存储系统由多个不同层级的数据存储位置构成，其容量通常与带宽呈反向关系，即容量越大的存储层级通常具有越低的访问带宽</span></strong></p><ul list="u19f9022c"><li fid="u016f40e3" data-lake-id="u526fd25d" id="u526fd25d"><strong><span data-lake-id="uec5e5089" id="uec5e5089">Global Memory（GMEM）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u13bc3620" id="u13bc3620">，通常也称为 HBM，是位于芯片外部的 DRAM，可由所有 Streaming Multiprocessor（SM）访问。从 GMEM 读取的数据会透明地缓存在芯片上的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0813c145" id="u0813c145">L2 Cache</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue8a6d06b" id="ue8a6d06b"> 中</span></li><li fid="u016f40e3" data-lake-id="u81a83207" id="u81a83207"><span data-lake-id="u496f78f7" id="u496f78f7">每个 SM 内部都包含容量较小、位于片上的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u85144738" id="u85144738">Shared Memory（SMEM）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1d647f40" id="u1d647f40">。SMEM 由程序员显式管理，并采用高度 Banked 的存储结构</span></li><li fid="u016f40e3" data-lake-id="u12993b65" id="u12993b65"><span data-lake-id="u4a8a5061" id="u4a8a5061">每个 SM 内部还包含 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub5ac08fc" id="ub5ac08fc">Register File</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u40f51d9e" id="u40f51d9e">，用于为各个 Thread 提供私有的高速寄存器存储空间</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufdf93e4d" id="ufdf93e4d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u084f74b4" id="u084f74b4" style="color: #5C0036">GPU 的编程模型围绕 Thread 这一最基本的逻辑执行单元进行组织</span></strong></p><ul list="u04144f59"><li fid="u8dc03f81" data-lake-id="u990608e9" id="u990608e9"><span data-lake-id="u7db95258" id="u7db95258">从粒度最细到最粗，其线程层次结构依次为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4fa20d27" id="u4fa20d27">Thread → Warp → Warpgroup → Threadblock/CTA → Threadblock Cluster → Grid</span></strong></li><li fid="u8dc03f81" data-lake-id="uf0d18d4f" id="uf0d18d4f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0833ca46" id="u0833ca46">Thread</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6b23942f" id="u6b23942f">：GPU 中最细粒度的逻辑执行单元，每个 Thread 执行相同 Kernel 中的一条执行路径，并拥有自己独立的寄存器状态。Thread 的私有数据通常优先存放在高速的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u623f3fde" id="u623f3fde">Register Memory </span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf86c76ec" id="uf86c76ec">中</span></li><li fid="u8dc03f81" data-lake-id="u95390e8a" id="u95390e8a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u324c9879" id="u324c9879">Warp</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc61ba378" id="uc61ba378">：NVIDIA GPU 将 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub7a1ff68" id="ub7a1ff68">32 个 Thread</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u45b602c6" id="u45b602c6"> 组织为一个 Warp，并由 Warp Scheduler 统一调度执行。通常情况下，同一个 Warp 内的线程执行相同指令，因此 Warp 是 GPU 实际指令调度和执行的基本粒度之一</span></li><li fid="u8dc03f81" data-lake-id="u0c49a6dd" id="u0c49a6dd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u36600017" id="u36600017">Warpgroup</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue9d773d1" id="ue9d773d1">：在 Hopper 架构中，4 个连续 Warp（128 个 Thread）可以进一步组成一个 Warpgroup。Hopper 的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubac86fc3" id="ubac86fc3">WGMMA</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucb08d106" id="ucb08d106"> 等 Tensor Core 指令以 Warpgroup 为协作粒度，使多个 Warp 能够共同完成一次较大规模的矩阵乘法计算</span></li><li fid="u8dc03f81" data-lake-id="uc88a1888" id="uc88a1888"><strong><span data-lake-id="u828c847d" id="u828c847d">Threadblock / CTA（Cooperative Thread Array）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9d2128ed" id="u9d2128ed">：一个 CTA 由若干 Warp 组成，并整体调度到</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc01fb56f" id="uc01fb56f">同一个 SM</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue7f5404f" id="ue7f5404f"> 上运行。同一 CTA 内的线程可以通过 Shared Memory 共享数据，并利用同步原语进行协作，因此 CTA 是 CUDA Kernel 中最重要的线程协作单元</span></li><li fid="u8dc03f81" data-lake-id="u03c7d683" id="u03c7d683"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc3b9b343" id="uc3b9b343">Threadblock Cluster</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucd3db9c9" id="ucd3db9c9">：Hopper 架构进一步引入Threadblock Cluster，将多个 CTA 组织为更高一级的协作单元。同一 Cluster 中的 CTA 会被协同调度到同一个 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf48cce73" id="uf48cce73">GPC </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u126d0ce8" id="u126d0ce8">内，并能够利用 Hopper 提供的跨 CTA 协作与 Distributed Shared Memory 等机制进行更大范围的数据共享</span></li><li fid="u8dc03f81" data-lake-id="u530e8ae9" id="u530e8ae9"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf86802bb" id="uf86802bb">Grid</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udc617021" id="udc617021">：Grid 是一次 Kernel Launch 所创建的全部 Threadblock 的集合，也是 CUDA 编程模型中最高层级的并行结构。Grid 中大量 CTA 会根据 GPU 的可用资源动态分配到不同 SM 上执行，从而实现整个 GPU 范围内的大规模并行</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaa3f953b" id="uaa3f953b"><span data-lake-id="u30746cdb" id="u30746cdb">线程层次结构与 GPU 的硬件及存储层次密切相关：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u26a9c02a" id="u26a9c02a">Thread 主要使用私有 Register，Warp/Warpgroup 负责细粒度的协同执行，CTA 被调度至单个 SM 并共享 SMEM，Cluster 将多个 CTA 扩展到 GPC 范围，而 Grid 则覆盖整个 GPU</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u94243f66" id="u94243f66" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1788479749079-ba6fb0bf-28d5-49cf-8b2e-006102bbc204.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8ae325ed-ee97-4619-a97d-bc8868c9a62%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9f65e9c5-c3ce-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A834.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A170%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A83586%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1117%2C%22originHeight%22%3A227%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22228KIBPERSML%2C31TB%2FSPERG%22%2C%22x%22%3A697%2C%22y%22%3A153%2C%22width%22%3A342%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAPACITYOBANDWIDTH%22%2C%22x%22%3A689%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A304%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NVIDIAHOPPERHIOOSXM5GPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A582%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A430%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2250MIBQ12TB%2FS%22%2C%22x%22%3A696%2C%22y%22%3A126%2C%22width%22%3A228%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2280GIBQ3.35TB%2FS%22%2C%22x%22%3A692%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A235%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARALLELAGENT%22%2C%22x%22%3A248%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A183%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HARDWARELEVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A193%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THREADBLOCKCLUSTER%22%2C%22x%22%3A249%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A230%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THREAD-MLEMO%22%2C%22x%22%3A180%2C%22y%22%3A9%2C%22width%22%3A184%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THREADBLOCKCTA%22%2C%22x%22%3A254%2C%22y%22%3A158%2C%22width%22%3A224%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATALOCALE%22%2C%22x%22%3A522%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEM%22%2C%22x%22%3A527%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22256KIBPERSM%22%2C%22x%22%3A698%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A178%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SMEMI%22%2C%22x%22%3A518%2C%22y%22%3A154%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TABLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A89%2C%22y%22%3A6%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HREAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A254%2C%22y%22%3A188%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THREAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A149%2C%22y%22%3A188%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPC%22%2C%22x%22%3A173%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HIERARCHY%22%2C%22x%22%3A372%2C%22y%22%3A12%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CHIP%22%2C%22x%22%3A164%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GRID%22%2C%22x%22%3A252%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RMIEM%22%2C%22x%22%3A517%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A84%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%22%2C%22x%22%3A521%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SM%22%2C%22x%22%3A179%2C%22y%22%3A153%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORTHENVLLDLAHC%22%2C%22x%22%3A516%2C%22y%22%3A13%2C%22width%22%3A216%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f2f0%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0cad5459%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u99c843d5" id="u99c843d5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ce14f47" id="u9ce14f47">GPU 本质上是一种面向吞吐率的处理器，主要依靠高并发与异步执行来隐藏内存访问延迟和指令执行延迟。对于 GMEM 与 SMEM 之间的异步数据搬运，Hopper 引入专用硬件单元 Tensor Memory Accelerator（TMA）</span></strong></p><ul list="u2e26138b"><li fid="u64ba1d5a" data-lake-id="u894b3876" id="u894b3876"><span data-lake-id="u369fe7ec" id="u369fe7ec">与 Ampere 等上一代架构不同，Hopper Tensor Core 可以通过面向整个 Warpgroup 的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc3d0589c" id="uc3d0589c">WGMMA </span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf4965219" id="uf4965219">指令进行访问。WGMMA 本身采用异步执行方式，并且能够直接从 Shared Memory 中读取输入数据</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u98e2faf1" id="u98e2faf1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u759f648e" id="u759f648e">GPU 对异步执行的硬件支持进一步催生 Warp-specialized Kernel。在这种 Kernel 中，一个 CTA 内的不同 Warp 被划分为不同角色：</span></strong></p><ul list="u51633c0f"><li fid="u9096311c" data-lake-id="u76404763" id="u76404763"><strong><span data-lake-id="u819468c2" id="u819468c2">Producer Warp</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2eb0b1e8" id="u2eb0b1e8">：主要负责数据搬运</span></li><li fid="u9096311c" data-lake-id="u381f33cd" id="u381f33cd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u28598157" id="u28598157">Consumer Warp</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udf6f1f65" id="udf6f1f65">：主要负责实际计算</span></li><li fid="u9096311c" data-lake-id="u920ae414" id="u920ae414"><span data-lake-id="u620935f3" id="u620935f3">通过将数据搬运和计算分配至不同 Warp，可以提高编译器生成高效指令调度的能力，并进一步实现不同硬件单元之间的执行重叠</span></li><li fid="u9096311c" data-lake-id="u9647414b" id="u9647414b"><span data-lake-id="u7978a07a" id="u7978a07a">Hopper 还支持通过 </span><code data-lake-id="u38c6d69b" id="u38c6d69b"><span data-lake-id="ue2603933" id="ue2603933">setmaxnreg</span></code><span data-lake-id="ueaea3d2b" id="ueaea3d2b"> 在不同 Warpgroup 之间</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua73e79b3" id="ua73e79b3">动态重新分配寄存器资源</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u19e5768d" id="u19e5768d">。因此，负责执行 MMA 的 Warp 可以获得更大比例的 RMEM，而仅负责发射 TMA 操作的 Warp 则只需要较少的寄存器资源，因为发射 TMA 操作实际上只需要单个 Thread</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u37a8f569" id="u37a8f569"><strong><span data-lake-id="u13b8f5cd" id="u13b8f5cd" style="color: #270070">现代 GPU 配备专用于低精度计算的硬件单元。例如，在 Hopper GPU 上，WGMMA 可以直接使用 FP8 Tensor Core，与 FP16 或 BF16 相比，其单个 SM 的理论计算吞吐率可以提高约 2 倍。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u60ca85c4" id="u60ca85c4">要正确使用 WGMMA，需要满足其对 Operand Memory Layout 的特定要求</span></p><ul list="uce1f1f6f"><li fid="ua08aa923" data-lake-id="u5990c70e" id="u5990c70e"><span data-lake-id="ubcc56776" id="ubcc56776">考虑 GEMM 计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22AB%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ac9ef7ddc90740fb681274d6aea47c2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y0yAj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a43f4d7" id="u7a43f4d7">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22A%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BM%5C%5Ctimes%20K%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdd02cd58a303636973043016e2eb70c2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JQG9z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4271eff1" id="u4271eff1">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BN%5C%5Ctimes%20K%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712f35a30108825163845c524c3663d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s1HpE%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u602e1c3f" id="u602e1c3f">。如果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde951302f41d4707b9d80ca1af34dd0f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TQMAc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f6c6d1e" id="u3f6c6d1e">或</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54f5fb1b07a88521e7b036e3bc7a5e33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uhKzH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u449f3b57" id="u449f3b57">在外部的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tkzOK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u82b568bb" id="u82b568bb">或</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CEk8u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1367f33a" id="u1367f33a">维度上连续，则称其采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5121735f" id="u5121735f">mn-major</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua1ca5635" id="ua1ca5635"> 布局；如果数据在内部的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dKMRL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee1d7f51" id="uee1d7f51">维度上连续，则称其采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uea3bc4a5" id="uea3bc4a5">k-major</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc42e1d4d" id="uc42e1d4d"> 布局</span></li><li fid="ua08aa923" data-lake-id="u17e51ed6" id="u17e51ed6"><span data-lake-id="u3c81d09f" id="u3c81d09f">对于 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0d1b17b8" id="u0d1b17b8">FP16 WGMMA</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucee99a05" id="ucee99a05">，当 Operand 位于 SMEM 中时，mn-major 和 k-major 两种输入布局均受到支持；而对于 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue3ebc996" id="ue3ebc996">FP8 WGMMA</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue30ccb23" id="ue30ccb23">，则仅支持 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u750334fe" id="u750334fe">k-major</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucaa0c207" id="ucaa0c207"> 格式</span></li><li fid="ua08aa923" data-lake-id="uda8962b5" id="uda8962b5"><span data-lake-id="u334bc3f1" id="u334bc3f1">Attention 通常需要在同一个 Kernel 中连续执行多个 GEMM，而前一个 GEMM 的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9db01821" id="u9db01821">FP32 Accumulator</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5f69ebda" id="u5f69ebda"> 会直接作为后一个 FP8 GEMM 的 Operand。因此，FP32 Accumulator 与 FP8 Operand 对数据布局的不同要求，会对连续调用具有数据依赖关系的 FP8 WGMMA 构成障碍。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u49c3d363" id="u49c3d363">因此，在 Attention 场景中，这些 Layout 限制要求对 FP8 Attention 算法进行针对性的重新设计</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="PbPjI" id="PbPjI" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="udec27785" id="udec27785">🐮</span><span data-lake-id="ub7877552" id="ub7877552"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4489d781" id="u4489d781">𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐝𝐮𝐜𝐞𝐫-𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐮𝐦𝐞𝐫 𝐚𝐬𝐲𝐧𝐜𝐡𝐫𝐨𝐧𝐲 𝐭𝐡𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐠𝐡 𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐩-𝐬𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐩𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐩𝐨𝐧𝐠 𝐬𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐝𝐮𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="ub6ed2942" id="ub6ed2942"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3f542205" id="u3f542205" style="color: #70000D">FlashAttention-3 的前向传播可以沿 Batch、Attention Head 和 Query Sequence Length 三个维度进行并行。算法从 CTA 粒度进行组织：每个 CTA 负责处理 Query 的一个 Block</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffaa143acde253f22886ce3f79ab71ff2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GGAQy%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3b25cd86" id="u3b25cd86" style="color: #70000D">，并计算对应的 Block</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb00ba7414933e0af3ce9df9ee3676b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zxP08%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6c644a49" id="u6c644a49" style="color: #70000D">。设 Query Block Size 为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92101bef7dc52db32d310c0564781483.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CHDjl%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0be707b5" id="u0be707b5" style="color: #70000D">，则长度为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F459f3c80a50b7be28751b0869ef5386a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oX2Ea%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u63bef5b0" id="u63bef5b0" style="color: #70000D">的 Query 被划分为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T_r%3D%5C%5Clceil%20N%2FB_r%5C%5Crceil%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc1dd705f8d76619d08c2506cb2fdebf9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qqc9f%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u849f3c5a" id="u849f3c5a" style="color: #70000D">个 Block</span></strong></p><ul list="u6bf85de9"><li fid="uf0155f59" data-lake-id="u18ecdb4e" id="u18ecdb4e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u282ce084" id="u282ce084">Producer Warpgroup</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u685df8cd" id="u685df8cd"> 主要负责数据搬运，利用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uef8126ab" id="uef8126ab">TMA</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1e0e6693" id="u1e0e6693"> 将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffaa143acde253f22886ce3f79ab71ff2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BfVUS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0cd5a657" id="u0cd5a657">以及各个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K_j%2CV_j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f56dea8365f3ff375d86dc69e3070d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SYGM2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u249a29ff" id="u249a29ff"> Block 从 HBM 异步加载至循环式 SMEM Buffer</span></li><li fid="uf0155f59" data-lake-id="u2b26352b" id="u2b26352b"><strong><span data-lake-id="udd586dcf" id="udd586dcf">Consumer Warpgroup</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4a325b19" id="u4a325b19"> 负责实际计算，利用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a58edab" id="u6a58edab">WGMMA</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue14a95e8" id="ue14a95e8"> 执行</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22QK%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe8543a14174f23603bc545d16da1beac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O2kvL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub8307acc" id="ub8307acc">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22PV%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ac90548ef923558b8816b8d5c2a5c14.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yyq2T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89b9006b" id="u89b9006b">两个 GEMM，同时完成局部 Softmax 和输出累积</span></li><li fid="uf0155f59" data-lake-id="u1cedade2" id="u1cedade2"><span data-lake-id="u3dc47e02" id="u3dc47e02">Hopper 的</span><code data-lake-id="u39b0dbca" id="u39b0dbca"><span data-lake-id="ue8492860" id="ue8492860">setmaxnreg</span></code><span data-lake-id="u00918be7" id="u00918be7">机制用于在 Producer 与 Consumer 之间动态重新分配寄存器，使执行 GEMM 的 Consumer 获得更多寄存器资源</span></li><li fid="uf0155f59" data-lake-id="u27e49d09" id="u27e49d09"><span data-lake-id="u18ae33c8" id="u18ae33c8">由于 TMA Load 本身是异步的，Producer 无需等待前一次数据搬运结束后才能发射下一次 Load。在最初若干次迭代中，Producer 可以持续填充循环 Buffer，从而将 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub678ee89" id="ub678ee89">HBM → SMEM 数据搬运与 Tensor Core 计算形成流水化执行</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua0edf838" id="ua0edf838">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u80d52739" id="u80d52739"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua0d5cfa0" id="ua0d5cfa0" style="color: #70000D">仅实现异步数据搬运仍不足以充分利用 Hopper，因为 Softmax 中的指数、浮点乘加等非 GEMM 操作，其硬件吞吐率远低于 Tensor Core GEMM</span></strong></p><ul list="ud6359750"><li fid="uec38272f" data-lake-id="uf36e0640" id="uf36e0640"><span data-lake-id="u65564235" id="u65564235">H100 SXM5 的 FP16 Matrix Multiplication 吞吐率约为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uaf0ff23b" id="uaf0ff23b">989 TFLOPS</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udfb8d5b4" id="udfb8d5b4">，而指数等特殊函数的吞吐率仅约为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0ec6bdd8" id="u0ec6bdd8">3.9 TFLOPS</span></strong></li><li fid="uec38272f" data-lake-id="u560cd734" id="u560cd734"><span data-lake-id="ua03d76b0" id="ua03d76b0">对于 Head Dimension 为 128 的 FP16 Attention，虽然矩阵乘法 FLOPs 约为指数运算的 512 倍，但指数运算的吞吐率约低 256 倍，因此其执行开销仍可能达到 GEMM 执行周期的约一半。FP8 下 GEMM 吞吐率进一步提高，而指数运算吞吐率基本不变，因此这一问题更加突出</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3380d88d" id="u3380d88d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u44d1a8a5" id="u44d1a8a5" style="color: #70000D">FlashAttention-3 提出 Ping-Pong Scheduling。两个 Consumer Warpgroup 交替执行 GEMM 与 Softmax</span></strong></p><ul list="u10298c51"><li fid="u2de2ff34" data-lake-id="u229aba76" id="u229aba76"><strong><span data-lake-id="u16683cf9" id="u16683cf9">Warpgroup 1 执行 Softmax 时，Warpgroup 2 执行 GEMM；随后二者交换角色</span></strong></li><li fid="u2de2ff34" data-lake-id="u1b33dfc4" id="u1b33dfc4"><span data-lake-id="u10948eb5" id="u10948eb5">这样可以让由独立硬件单元执行的 Softmax 与 Tensor Core 上的 GEMM 并行进行，从而将部分 Softmax 开销隐藏在 GEMM 的执行时间之下。作者通过 Barrier 控制两个 Warpgroup 的调度顺序，使一个 Warpgroup 的 Softmax 尽可能与另一个 Warpgroup 的 GEMM 重叠</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4a6867d8" id="u4a6867d8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790381051512-902a9529-9c33-4331-b6fd-6d22f12a152d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9f1dee66-47c5-45e0-acd7-4e7bb6a673a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf0b958f2-65bb-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A872%2C%22height%22%3A164%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A49139%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1550%2C%22originHeight%22%3A292%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARPGROUP1%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WARPGROUP2%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFTMAX%22%2C%22x%22%3A658%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GEMMO%22%2C%22x%22%3A320%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTMAX%22%2C%22x%22%3A317%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GEMMO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1209%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMM1%22%2C%22x%22%3A434%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFTMAX%22%2C%22x%22%3A1102%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GEMMO%22%2C%22x%22%3A212%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTMAX%22%2C%22x%22%3A1314%2C%22y%22%3A167%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GEMM1%22%2C%22x%22%3A1095%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMM0%22%2C%22x%22%3A769%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GEMM1%22%2C%22x%22%3A650%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTMA%22%2C%22x%22%3A870%2C%22y%22%3A167%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMMO%22%2C%22x%22%3A988%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFTMAX%22%2C%22x%22%3A438%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TIME%22%2C%22x%22%3A785%2C%22y%22%3A259%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMM0%22%2C%22x%22%3A546%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GEMM%22%2C%22x%22%3A875%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f1f0%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u988ef3b2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="gxrLu" id="gxrLu" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u616888c8" id="u616888c8">🦓</span><span data-lake-id="u9c0822b1" id="u9c0822b1"> 𝐈𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐚-𝐖𝐚𝐫𝐩𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐩 𝐎𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐥𝐚𝐩𝐩𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐆𝐄𝐌𝐌𝐬 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐒𝐨𝐟𝐭𝐦𝐚𝐱</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ufff67541" id="ufff67541"><strong><span data-lake-id="u75323a93" id="u75323a93">通过额外的寄存器缓冲区，构建跨迭代的两阶段流水线，使同一 warpgroup 内的 GEMM 与 softmax 重叠执行</span></strong></p><ul list="u3ce4a8e9"><li fid="u4e27deea" data-lake-id="uf41efc31" id="uf41efc31"><span data-lake-id="ucf01f23d" id="ucf01f23d">具体而言，异步发起第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4b03314bc50edeec42b817d6943da0f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k6vDX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1624a02b" id="u1624a02b">块的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22QK%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe8543a14174f23603bc545d16da1beac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XPqgQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73b7736e" id="u73b7736e"> GEMM 和第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20j-1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47c3294fd88f6ba922a700533d94e807.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C3RzS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud39fad4c" id="ud39fad4c">块的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22PV%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ac90548ef923558b8816b8d5c2a5c14.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F1ttM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u563e216b" id="u563e216b">GEMM；当第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4b03314bc50edeec42b817d6943da0f2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22N8Ic5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u133c7e71" id="u133c7e71">块的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22QK%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe8543a14174f23603bc545d16da1beac.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ywcxg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b901ee4" id="u0b901ee4">完成后，即可计算该块的 softmax，同时让前一块的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20PV%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F16d96766cc8229d633ef14556ac283ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V3LXK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubcfffb09" id="ubcfffb09">GEMM 继续执行。待前一块的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20PV%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F16d96766cc8229d633ef14556ac283ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x8ZLP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uded3f27f" id="uded3f27f">GEMM 完成后，再对输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22O_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdb00ba7414933e0af3ce9df9ee3676b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qo0PC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf12c6ec7" id="uf12c6ec7">进行重缩放，并推进流水线</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u00843ae2" id="u00843ae2"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueb7cddbc" id="ueb7cddbc">尽管上述流水线结构在理论上能够带来性能收益，但在实践中仍有几个方面需要考虑</span></strong></p><ul list="uba555f11"><li fid="uf719d9d1" data-lake-id="u41695693" id="u41695693"><strong><span data-lake-id="uedc03b08" id="uedc03b08">编译器指令重排。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7f1058c9" id="u7f1058c9"> 伪代码呈现的是理想化的执行顺序，但编译器（NVCC）经常会出于优化目的重新排列指令。这可能扰乱精心设计的 WGMMA 与非 WGMMA 操作之间的流水线执行顺序，进而导致非预期行为或削弱性能收益</span></li><li fid="uf719d9d1" data-lake-id="u19c22560" id="u19c22560"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf9f05732" id="uf9f05732">寄存器压力。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9fe9e218" id="u9fe9e218"> 为保持最佳性能，应尽可能减少寄存器溢出。然而，两阶段流水线需要额外的寄存器来存储中间结果，并维护阶段之间的上下文。具体而言，需要在寄存器中额外保留一个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnext%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcc0f089a8ec741786827377b9cbb3842.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22I5aOg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u989698ca" id="u989698ca">，使每个线程块增加</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B_r%20%5C%5Ctimes%20B_c%20%5C%5Ctimes%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsizeof%7D(%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bfloat%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F46fd11873c87835b62c60ab2aa7da6cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qN2oO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3d2dfc13" id="u3d2dfc13">大小的寄存器用量。寄存器需求的增加可能与采用更大分块尺寸这一常见优化手段产生冲突，因为更大的分块同样需要大量寄存器</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u30af1cd6" id="u30af1cd6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u64a2d777" id="u64a2d777">三阶段流水线。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u289193c4" id="u289193c4"> 在上述两阶段算法的基础上，提出一种三阶段变体，以进一步增加第二个 WGMMA 与 softmax 的重叠程度。尽管这种方法有望进一步提高 Tensor Core 的利用率，但新增的流水线阶段需要更多寄存器，使分块尺寸与流水线深度之间的权衡更加困难</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="nbf8b" id="nbf8b" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="udc8f6874" id="udc8f6874">🐼</span><span data-lake-id="u99a6edb1" id="u99a6edb1"> 𝐋𝐨𝐰-𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐅𝐏𝟖</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uc11b0894" id="uc11b0894"><span data-lake-id="ud415e67b" id="ud415e67b">以 FP8 精度计算 FlashAttention-3 的前向传播时，在满足布局要求方面会遇到 FP16 中不存在的额外挑战。对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xXcGh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udcf6ca69" id="udcf6ca69">的布局变换，有两种方案</span></p><ul list="u33372512"><li fid="ud5713e0d" data-lake-id="u15f1ca58" id="u15f1ca58"><strong><span data-lake-id="u823dff39" id="u823dff39">方案一</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6d0df3ac" id="u6d0df3ac">是在预处理阶段对全局内存（GMEM）中的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RHQQR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4956ed14" id="u4956ed14"> 进行转置</span></li><li fid="ud5713e0d" data-lake-id="u53cfbcea" id="u53cfbcea"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9887b937" id="u9887b937">方案二</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u79e9e8d7" id="u79e9e8d7">是将 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QuCEQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9509cdfc" id="u9509cdfc"> 分块加载到共享内存（SMEM）后，在内核中进行转置。方案（1）可以将转置融合到前序操作（如旋转位置编码）的收尾阶段，或调用独立的预处理转置内核，交换序列长度维度与注意力头维度的步长。但前者难以集成到标准库中，后者在推理等受内存带宽限制的场景下开销过大<br /><br /></span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud7babe11" id="ud7babe11"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf19fa610" id="uf19fa610">FP8 FlashAttention-3 采用方案二，利用 LDSM（ldmatrix）和 STSM（stmatrix）指令完成内核内转置。这些指令由一个 warp 内的线程协同执行，以 128 字节为粒度，在 SMEM 与寄存器内存之间搬运数据，并能够在搬运过程中完成布局转置</span></strong></p><ul list="u6c7f1a81"><li fid="ubb15776f" data-lake-id="uc1586c39" id="uc1586c39"><span data-lake-id="u8f07de84" id="u8f07de84">由于寄存器开销较低，它们可以在生产者 warpgroup 中执行。此外，从第一次迭代之后开始，下一个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oSa2X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u670217ff" id="u670217ff">分块的转置可以与涉及前一个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C4OFi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua17e9817" id="ua17e9817">分块和当前 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jhw8N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u52826c5c" id="u52826c5c"> 分块的两个 WGMMA 重叠执行</span></li><li fid="ubb15776f" data-lake-id="u809a69f3" id="u809a69f3"><span data-lake-id="ue6131555" id="ue6131555">与 FP16 不同，FP8 WGMMA 的 FP32 累加器布局与其操作数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fde951302f41d4707b9d80ca1af34dd0f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MXz8c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua8636ea7" id="ua8636ea7">存放在寄存器中时所要求的布局不一致。因此，需要使用字节置换指令，将第一个 WGMMA 的累加器转换为适合第二个 WGMMA 的格式，同时与内核内转置生成的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a9y57%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u75ba876c" id="u75ba876c">分块布局相匹配</span></li><li fid="ubb15776f" data-lake-id="ub6d01e33" id="ub6d01e33"><span data-lake-id="u4b847241" id="u4b847241">将元素顺序调整为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%7Bd_0%2Cd_1%2Cd_4%2Cd_5%2Cd_2%2Cd_3%2Cd_6%2Cd_7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5899c32674efc5c5ec0aa1eec4ff7568.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JtOBA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3eedc4bb" id="u3eedc4bb">，并对每个 8 字节组重复这一置换。从逻辑上看，这相当于置换</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fffd1905f6d4d60accedfa6b91be93ea9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jE5pv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94ee7b23" id="u94ee7b23">分块的列，例如第 0、1、8、9 列成为前四列。为保证 WGMMA 计算出正确的输出，还需在内核内转置时，对写出的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wrR6r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4dc78f15" id="u4dc78f15"> 分块进行相匹配的行置换</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u589722cf" id="u589722cf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790382893362-6598e8fc-5cba-4546-be53-6482febd35ed.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5031ad6f-99af-4cd3-8919-9bbea4ecfbe%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u29001ddc-99b6-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A992%2C%22height%22%3A284%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A152384%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1240%2C%22originHeight%22%3A355%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22FIGURE3%3AFP32ACCUMULATORREGISTERVGLMMLALAYOUT-TOWS0AND8%2CTHREADS0-3%2CENTRIES0-7.%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A130%2C%22width%22%3A1117%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IGURE4%3AFP8OPERANDAREGISTERWGMMALAVOUT-ROWS0AND8THREADS0-3%2CENTRIES0-7.%22%2C%22x%22%3A86%2C%22y%22%3A313%2C%22width%22%3A1074%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T2(A4.A5T2(A6%2CA7T3A4%2CA5T3A6.%22%2C%22x%22%3A608%2C%22y%22%3A241%2C%22width%22%3A565%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A0.A1T21A2A3T3A0A1T3%7BA2A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A649%2C%22y%22%3A200%2C%22width%22%3A571%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22D6.D7T2D6%2CD7HR3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A795%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A341%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T0A4A5T0A6A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A30%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A290%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T0A0.A110A2%2CA3%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A202%2C%22width%22%3A310%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T0D2.D3T1%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A202%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220D6%2CD7%22%2C%22x%22%3A628%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T1A6%2CA7%22%2C%22x%22%3A462%2C%22y%22%3A245%2C%22width%22%3A161%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%227T1A4%2CA5%22%2C%22x%22%3A287%2C%22y%22%3A244%2C%22width%22%3A180%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HT1A0O%2CA1%22%2C%22x%22%3A299%2C%22y%22%3A203%2C%22width%22%3A189%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220DO.D1T1%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A186%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22D2%2CD3%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T1A2%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A459%2C%22y%22%3A204%2C%22width%22%3A123%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A3T2A0%22%2C%22x%22%3A574%2C%22y%22%3A201%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210D4.%22%2C%22x%22%3A627%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.%2C0%22%2C%22x%22%3A237%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22D4%2CD%22%2C%22x%22%3A808%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22D0.D1%22%2C%22x%22%3A518%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e0c68e%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u094a7d24%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u120ba2ae" id="u120ba2ae"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9da2d2df" id="u9da2d2df">FP8（E4M3）格式仅使用 3 位存储尾数、4 位存储指数，因此其数值误差高于 FP16/BF16。此外，大模型通常存在幅值远大于其他大多数数值的离群值，这增加量化的难度。通常采用逐张量缩放，即为每个张量保留一个标量。为降低 FP8 注意力计算的数值误差，采用以下两种技术</span></strong></p><ul list="u6c7f1a81" start="4"><li fid="ubb15776f" data-lake-id="ufbd5570d" id="ufbd5570d"><span data-lake-id="ue7f3e39c" id="ue7f3e39c">分块量化。 为每个分块保留一个缩放因子，即将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yHIcv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09c244c1" id="u09c244c1">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VHYCi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u986111d2" id="u986111d2">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Fqwok%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f1ae6da" id="u6f1ae6da">分别划分为大小为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B_r%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F997c3e88f82d146639a70c09e19b7619.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yCuMG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7608aac" id="ub7608aac"> 或 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22B_c%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9588a2b90dc3d09f4139b2303725eb8a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tLp8e%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9972c01c" id="u9972c01c">的分块，并独立进行量化。该量化过程可以与紧邻注意力计算之前的操作（如旋转位置编码）融合，而不会带来额外的性能损失，因为旋转位置编码受内存带宽限制。由于 FlashAttention-3 算法本身以分块为单位执行，因此可以在不增加计算开销的情况下，对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55fc237afbe535f7d8434985b848a6a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ENwWF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f9f559a" id="u4f9f559a">的各个分块进行缩放，以计入分块量化所引入的缩放因子</span></li><li fid="ubb15776f" data-lake-id="uccdd6fd9" id="uccdd6fd9"><span data-lake-id="u6e34629a" id="u6e34629a">非相干处理。 为分散离群值，在量化为 FP8 之前，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PpT2j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf49ab837" id="uf49ab837">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tzw2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud29ebc98" id="ud29ebc98">分别乘以随机正交矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22m7CZv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93fd2781" id="u93fd2781">。由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kF4Mh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u87f6e09f" id="u87f6e09f">是正交矩阵，满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22MM%5E%5C%5Ctop%3DI%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9310d9fc3b4ea7d546cb18d574f7885e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Lw14k%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ude062444" id="ude062444">，因此 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(QM)(KM)%5E%5C%5Ctop%3DQK%5E%5C%5Ctop%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3a0a95a7f3b7c869cab2f8e1ba41e3b2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O42ao%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67274c6e" id="u67274c6e">，即同时将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KySQz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u24ca9b31" id="u24ca9b31">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pLAW0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5786df6" id="ua5786df6">乘以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VCj73%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2398c0fd" id="u2398c0fd">不会改变注意力输出。由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22QM%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F805eda82c48e33f5526db254076a186d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uHBME%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c0866ab" id="u6c0866ab">或</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22KM%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff34d7db360b2de397aec04fd6eec2cee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ieMCp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2a2d24ec" id="u2a2d24ec">的每个元素都是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ef7132d0df72d9e3db76f6391960a3d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NA2Pl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9b26593a" id="u9b26593a">或</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HguOW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4908b5e7" id="u4908b5e7">中各元素的随机加权和，这一操作能够分散离群值，从而降低量化误差</span></li></ul>